<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Lammaː Ruu tɔ̃vɨng riinɛ</book>
  <para style="h">Yɔhana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ruu Tɔ̃vɨn Au Shɛ A Yɔhana Naa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yɔhana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ruu Tɔ̃vɨn Au Shɛ A</para>
  <para style="mt1">YƆHANA NAA</para>
  <para style="imt">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Ruu Tɔ̃vɨn Au Shɛ A Yɔhana Naa tasinɛ Yesɔ kɔ ɔ̃rɛ ruu Ɗalapa gbete a koo yɛ,&lt;&lt; Rii shɔzɛ a ɔ̃ au tete.&gt;&gt;Ji nagbete laabeenɛm shayɛ nɛ, Ruu tɔ̃vɨn mi shɔ beerɛ aru shɔ ɓalinɛyi i ã-sisɨntɔ nɛ Yesɔ kɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔshɔranɛ gbete Ɗa maruu au yuuyɛ, Ɗa Jaa, a nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ au bi i kpaa suru gbete yisinya ɓayɛ (20.31.)</para>
  <para style="ip">Akɨnti yutasinɛ gbete tasinɛ Yesɔ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Ɗanyaruubii a koo dangdang, a gɨn-gɨn gaanɛ ruu tɔ̃vɨnmi, tasipɛ vibiizaanɛyi gbete au tasinɛ Yesɔ kɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔshɔranɛ gbete Ɗa maruu au yuu yɛ, Ɗa jaa. A pɛsi sɔ̃n a nya a shɔ nwaliyɛ gbete tadɔɔ ruugbete vibiizaanɛyi ɓeliyɛ. A nakawɔ laabeem sha nɔgbete shɔ gãsiyi ã sisɨn a Yesɔ bi, ai ɔ̃kɛ u shɔ gɨnnɛyi, shɔwɔyi ɔ̃kɛ Yesɔ shɔnɔpɔ̃ ai ɓɛ̃ɛ̃ sisɨn ãnɛtɔ au biini. U gɨn-gɨn 13-17 bee vitɔ waanɛ nɔgbete Yesɔ ɔ̃ shẽri au jaɗɔɔyini a zɨmba gbete shɔ sãuyɛ, geliyi ruu a masiyi bi i ɓɛɛ yɛnɛ u dii naa ɓanɛ laa. laabeem u gɨn-gɨn gbete kunaa yɛ nwanya aru Yesɔ sãnɛ a sisɨnntanɛ, u naa ɓanɛ laa a yunɛ saa, au shɛlinɛ au jadɔɔyi bi a knti yunɛ saa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ruuɓere su gbete shɔ sãu a kpantang pɛlinɛ yɛ. (8.1-11)</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk" closed="false">Yɔhana</char>
    <char style="bk" closed="false">ã kaka ayuu suru gbete yisinya ɓa a Kirisi kabii, ãnɛ au gaa dɔdɔtrim ama see shɔgbete i ã sisɨntɛ nɛ Yesɔ kɔ ɔ̃rɛ nyaba, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ ruu tɔ̃vɨn a suruni. A laabeenɛm vigbete Yɔhana ã kaka aɗɔn waanɛ, a pɛli vishonɛ a vigbete shɔ zɛ a lee lee yɛ aru u tasi shɔ ruu suru nizɛyi, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ naa, mii, borodi, ɗɔsẽsẽ, a jagamɛrɛ̃ au mɛrɛ̃ wɔsɔ̃n jaa nɔlaa inabi.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au Ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yuruu (1.1-18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yɔhana shɔ Batizima a Yesɔ jadɔɔ gbeteu gaa yɛ (1.19-51)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesɔ vishonɛ au pɛli shɔnɔɔ (2.1-12.50)</para>
  <para style="io1">Dii maanzii au wasinaa u si maani a Urushalima ni (13.1-19.42)</para>
  <para style="io1">Uɓeyelapa yunɛ saa au shɛlinɛ (20.1-31)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ruu onɛ: Yesɔ shɛnɛ wɔ a Galili (21.1-25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ruu Gbete Ã Suru Yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />A gaanɛ ruu siɗɔn, ruu si ji a Ɗalapa ni a ɗɔzɔ, ruu sijo Ɗalapa kɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Yuunɛ a gaanɛ ruu si a Ɗalapa ni. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Au kabiikɔ Ɗalapa pɛli vi piti kpai; A Ɗalapa vi shɛshinɛ kpai pɛli jo au nii kɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Ruu ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ nyaba suru kpaanɛ, Surunkɔ n ti ɗɔsẽsẽrɛ a shɔzɛ bi. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Ɗɔsẽsẽ kolirɛ a ɗɔkɨnri , ɗɔkɨnri ji kuki ɗɔsẽsẽ dɔɔɓa.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Ɗalapa shou jashonɛ, jaau u nii nɛ Yɔhana. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Yɔhana arɛ u geli shɔ ruu ɗɔsẽsẽ, nɛ kopiya u nta ruum u ã sisɨntɔ a ɗɔsẽsẽuni. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Yɔhana ubiiba u siɓa ɗɔsẽsẽukɔ ɓa; arɛ aru u geli shɔ ruu, aru ɗɔsẽsẽ. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Shomkɔ ɔ̃rɛ ɗɔsẽsẽ nizɛ, ɗɔsẽsẽ gbete arɛ a kootipi a koli a shɔ yuu piti kpai. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Ruum si ji a kootipikɔ, Ɗalapa pɛli kootipi ji au kabiikɔ, piti shomni kpai shɔ kootipi i ji zɛu nii ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />A arɛ aru u shɔbiiyi, ama ɓɛshɔzɛyi i ji tɛu naa ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Ama shɔ gbeteyi i tɛu naa piti kpai ai ã sisɨn au bi, kɛɗɔn a ãi naarɛ nɛi ɔ̃ Ɗa jaayi. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />I ji ɔ̃ Ɗa jaayi ɓa naa shɔzɛ ɓa, aruukɔ shɔ ji yeeyi ɓa a nyaba gbete shɔzɛ yee jaa yɛ ɓa, ama Ɗalapa au yuu ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ i ɓeye. <verse eid="JHN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Ruukɔ rii shɔzɛrɛ, ruu nizɛ tɔ̃vɨn tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ, u ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ au tete. U zɛu basinɛtɛ, bassinɛ jagbete au tɛ a ɓeye Ɗalapa naa yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yɔhana nwanya sitɛ au yuuni. Yɔhana sɨnnyavɔ a kakani a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmpɛ shɔgbete n nwanya si au yuuni gbete n tɔnɛ,&lt; Shɔ gbete yɛ a ang knti, ama tɛng tɛttɔ a kakani, aru iviya n ɓɛɛ yeenɛ u siɗɔn.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Au tete sisɨn tɔ̃vɨn kpai ãu nyabatɛ tasiu vɔ susãritɛ a bi piti kpai, Tasiu vɔ susãri gbete gbete kopiya. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Ɗalapa ã nya-ãsinɛ a Musa naa, ama a ãu sisɨn tɔ̃vɨn a nyaba tɔ̃vɨn ni a Yesɔ kirisi naa. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Shɔwɔ ji zɛ Ɗalapa ɓa au nɔni shãã ɓa, ama u jagbete ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Ɗalapa, u a ɓeyeni i zali, ukɔ pɔ̃urɛ u zɛ Ɗalapa nii rɛ.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɔhana Shɔ Batizima Ãnɛ Nyanwaanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi i sho gãsi shɔlansi a Urushalima a Lawiyawayini a Yɔhana ɗɔbii, nɛi hɨu pɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt;A ɓɛɛ piya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yɔhana ji bɛ̃ɛ̃ nya kasinɛɓa, nwanya ji nta yusẽɓa, a shanɛ:&lt;&lt;N ɓa kirisi ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />I hɨnɛ&lt;&lt; Akɛ piya? Mɔkaa Iliya ya?&gt;&gt; Yɔhana kasi nyanɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɓa, n ɓa ukɔ ɓa,&gt;&gt;I hɨu sɔ̃n nɛ, &lt;&lt;Mɔkaa kɛ janyagadi ya?&gt;&gt;Yɔhana risinyanɛ.&lt;&lt;Ɓa&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Kɛɗɔn i shanɛ&lt;&lt; geliu nɛ akɛ piya, nɗa u kpaa vigbete u yɛ geli shɔgbete i shouyɛrɛ, A shaɓɛkɛnɛ ivi aa yuuni viya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yɔhana kasiyinyarɛ a sha vigbete laabeenɛ janyagadi Ishaya shayɛ nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">&lt;&lt; Pɛ nkɔ Yeenya gbete a ɗɔɔ nya ɓaanɛ a ɗɔgbete laa ɓa ɗɔmɓayɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">Ɔ kɔri Uɓeyelapa nyaba gbɔrɔrɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Jashonɛ gbete, shɔ Farasiya i shoyɛ, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />i hɨ Yɔhana nɛ,&lt;&lt;A sitɛ ɓa kirisi ɓa, a ɓa Iliya ɓa, sɔ̃n ɓa janyagadi ɓa, kɛpi ruuvi a pɛli shɔ Batizima viya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yɔhana kasiyinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;N pɛlɔɔ Batizima a mii, ama awɔ tetem shɔwɔɔ a ɗɔɔ shinɛ gbete ɔ ji zɛuɓa. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />U ɗɔɔ anɛ ang knti, ama n ji tɛsiɓa n kaliu rii koodɔɔ rɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Vim kpai shɔ pɛli a Betani, a kagɨnri a nya ɓooti Urudu, a ɗɔgbete Yɔhana pɛli shɔ Batizimayɛ.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗa Jamɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />A dii ɓuru Yɔhana zɛ Yesɔ rɛ u ɗɔgbete au ɗɔbiiyɛ, kɛɗɔn a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Nkɔ Ɗa Jamɛrɛ yɛm, shɔgbete au tu shɔ ruuvini a kootipi piti kpai! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Shɔmpɛ shɔgbete ang nwanya si au yuu yɛkɔ n shanɛ,&lt;Jawɔɔ kaanɛ ang knti, ama tɛngtɛttɔ a kakani, aru viya nɓɛɛ yeenɛ u siɗɔn.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />N ang yuu si n ji zɛu ɓa kɔjɔ, ama n arɛ n ɗɔgbete n pɛli shɔ Batizima a mii a nɔgbete n tasiu shɔ Israila i zɛu niitɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Kɛɗɔn Yɔhana shi au yuu a shanɛ: &lt;&lt;N zɛ Ɗa Suru a ɗɔɔ nɔnɛ a kolapa naa koro, a ɔ̃ au yuu. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />N ang yuu si n ji zɛɓa nɛ ukɔ ɓa, see Ɗalapa gbete shonyɛ nɛn pɛli Batizima a mii, gelin nɛ,&lt; A yɛ zɛ Ɗa Surutɔ a ɗɔɔ nonɛ a jawɔɔ yuu; ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ gbete yɛ pɛli shɔ Batizima a Ɗa suru,&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Yɔhana shanɛ, n zɛ Ɗa suru tɛ, n gelɔɔtɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Ɗa jaa&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Jadɔɔ Gbete Gaa yuu A Yiniyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />A dii ɓuru toti Yɔhana u si ɗɔɔ shinɛ au jadɔɔyini ziti, <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Naa zɛ Yesɔ tɛ a ɗɔɔ rakinɛ a shanɛ. &lt;&lt; Ɔ kɨnnɔɔ pɛ, nkɔ Ɗa Jamɛrɛ yɛm!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Yɔhana jadɔɔyi ziti naa i nta vigbete shayɛtɛ i gɨn Yesɔ rɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesɔ zaanɔɔ, zɛyirɛ i ɗɔgbete i gɨuyɛ, a hɨyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ kã iviya?&gt;&gt;I kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;A ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ piya, Rabbi?&gt;&gt;(ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Shɔmala.) <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Kɛɗɔn a kasiyinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ anɛ ɔ zɛrɛ,&gt;&gt;( Si gɨnɗadɔɔ pɛlitɛ nɛ̃ɛti a niti.) kɛɗɔn i yɛrɛ awuni i zɛu ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛrɛ, ɗaa yisiyi kɛji ɗɔukɔ zɨlu. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Ai tete shɔwi si Anduru, Siman Bituru ɓɛzɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Tɛ̃ɛ̃ti a kpaa ɓɛzɔ̃ Siman geliunɛ &lt;&lt;U kpaa Shɔshɔranɛtɛ.&gt;&gt;( Ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ &lt;&lt;kirisi&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Kɛɗɔn tuu Siman a n-tiu Yesɔ ɗɔbiirɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesɔ zɛurɛ a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;A nii nɛ Siman Yɔhana ɓɛɛ jaa. Ama shɔyɛ ɓa,anɛ Kɛfasi&gt;&gt;(Ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ zali a nii gbete shɔ ɓa,anɛ Bituru, Bituru ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ &lt;&lt;Tari&gt;&gt;.)<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Ɓaa Filibu a Nataninya Nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Kɛ a dii ɓuru Yesɔ sɨn a sisɨn nɛn yɛ Galili. A kpaa Filibu a geliunɛ, &lt;&lt;Gɨnn pɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />(Filibu u si a Besaida, koomɔ gbete Anduru a Bituru i ɗɔnyɛ.) <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filibu kpaa Nataninya a geliunɛ,&lt;&lt;U kpaa shɔ gbete Musa bee vi au yuu a laabeenɛ nya-ãsinɛtɛ, wɔsɔ̃n shɔ gbete janyagadiyi i bee vi au yuuyɛtɛ. Upɛ Yesɔ Yusufu jaa, a Nazara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Nataninya hɨnɛ&lt;&lt;Vitɔ̃vɨng yɛ shɛ kati a Nazarani ya?&gt;&gt;Filibu kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Anɛ a zɛrɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Naa Yesɔ zɛ Nataninya tɛ kaanɛ au ɗɔbii, nwanya au yuu a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Nkɔ shɔ Israila tɔ̃vɨn yɛm; vi nyazɔ̃ ɓau biini ɓa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Nataninya hɨunɛ,&lt;&lt;A zɛmpi koviya?&gt;&gt;Yesɔ kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;N zɛa adɔɔ sɨnti si Filibu ji ɓaa nya pɛɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Nataninya kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmala, Apɛ Ɗa jaa! A kpati Israila!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesɔ shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Dɔdɔrim a ã tɔ̃vɨn ji aru gbete n gelaa n-tɛ n zɛa adɔɔ sɨnti ya? A yɛ zɛ vigbete au tɛɛ shɔmtɔ a banɛni!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt;N gelɔɔmi pɛ nizɛ: Ɔ yɛ zɛ kolapa ɓɛlitɛ ɔ zɛ Ɗajaashonɛlapa i ɗɔɔ lapa gẽnɛ a nonɛni a shɔzɛja yuu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yumusinɛ Aru So Tɛnɛ A Kana Tipi Galili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Akɨnti lee ziti shɔ pɛli yumusinɛ so tɛnɛ a koomo a Kana tipi Galili. Yesɔ ɓini u si ji a ɗɔukɔ, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />shɔ wa Yesɔ nya ji au jaadɔyini a ɗɔɔ yumusinɛ so tɛnɛuni. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Naa i mii inabi yisi nyatɛ,Yesɔ ɓini Mariyamu geliunɛ,&lt;&lt;U mii inabi toti ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesɔ risinyanɛ,&lt;&lt;Mɔkɔ gelin vigbete n yɛn pɛliyɛ kɛrɛya, n ɗaa ji pɛli pɛ̃nɛ̃ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Yesɔ ɓini geli Yesɔ jaawɛrɛyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Vigbete kɛ gelɔɔnɛ piti kpai ɔ pɛli-ɓɛjitɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Yahudawayi i nya-ãsinɛ aɗɔn gbete i gɨnyɛ aru visɔkinɛ, arumkɔ i ɓɛsɛ aɗɔn gbete shɔ maa a tari a ɗɔuni mangbete, ko-pi shɔpiya tuu mɛnɛ lita laa maani. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesɔ geliu jaawɛrɛyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ yiki kparimiyinɛ a mii.&gt;&gt;I yikirɛ lot-lot, <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />kɛɗɔn geliyinɛ,&lt;&lt;Dɔdɔrim ɔ onɛ ɔ n ti yupɛ̃ni yumusinɛ so tɛnɛrɛ.&gt;&gt;I n-tiu miiurɛ, <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Kɛɗɔn miiu rikɛ mii inabi, jagbete tɛ sou nta miiurɛ au rii mii inabiu, ji zɛ ɗɔgbete mii shɛ aɗɔn ɓa, (Ama jaawɛrɛyi gbete i n ti miiu i zɛ ɓɛtɛttɔ); kɛɗɔn ɓaa jagbete tɛ sou nyarɛ, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />a geliunɛ,&lt;&lt;Kopiya si shɔ ãu pɛji mii inabi tɔ̃vɨn kɔ ɗekɨn, naa shɔ yumusiyi so tɛnɛ i kɛ ɓoonɛ a yukarara, kɛɗɔn u n ti gbeteu kaka ɓa ɓamɓa kɛkn. Ama a ɓusi mii anabi tɔ̃vɨn see dɔdɔrim!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Yesɔ gaa vibii-zaanɛm pɛlinɛ a kana a tipi Galili; tasiu bassinɛ a ɗɔukɔ, u jadɔɔyi i ã sisɨntɔ au biini. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Kɛu kɨnti ni, Yesɔ a ɓini, ɓɛzɔ̃yi au jadɔɔyini i yɛkɛ Kapanahum i ɔ̃ a ɗɔukɔ dii mɛnɛ dɔɔ ziti.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Koo Wɛrɛ Ɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Naa shɔ Yahudawayi ɗagbete i sha vishaanɛ aru yumusinɛ tɛnɛda atɛ maani, Yesɔ yɛkɛ Urushalima. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />A jaa Ɗa gakinɛ kpaa shɔ a ɗɔɔ napu, mɛrɛ̃ɛ̃ a koroni mɛlinɛ, a shɔ saa kɔsinɛyi i ɔ̃tɛ a tɛburuyi. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Kɛɗɔn zaa rii kpataa a yikiyi awuni a shɛshi vivaayi ɓili, mɛrɛ a napu ni a jaa Ɗa; sãti shɔ saa kɔsinɛyi i teburuyi a saani a tipi kpai; <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />A ãsi shɔ koroyi mɛlinɛyi i nya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ shɛshi koroyi kati a ɗɔnni! Ɔkɔ risi mayɛ wɛrɛnɛ lumo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />U jadɔɔyi i kpaa sisɨn rɛ a yuu vigbete laabeenɛ shayɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt;N kaagɨntɛ aru wɛrɛ gbete shɔ gakaa aɗɔnyɛ bang.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Shɔ Yahudawayi i risi Yesɔ nya i hɨnɛ, &lt;&lt;A yɛ tasiu kɛpi vibiizaanɛ gbete piya gbete yɛ tasuunɛ a kaka vim pɛlinɛ aɗɔn viya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesɔ kasiyinyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ zɨnlinɛ wɛrɛ Ɗannɛ, n yɛn maa sɔ̃n a lee taati.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Kɛɗɔn i hɨunɛ&lt;&lt;wɛrɛ Ɗam tuu saa laa ziti atu maangbete shɔ ɗɔɔ maanɛ! A tɔnɛn maa sɔ̃n a lee taati ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Ama wɛrɛ Ɗa gbete Yesɔ nwanya ayuu ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ u bi. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Arumkɔ akɨnti gbete Yesɔ yulapa a sàà, u jadɔɔyi i kpaa sɨsɨn tɔnɛ sha vimtɛ, i ã sisɨntɔ a Ɗa nya ruubiini, a vigbete Yesɔ shayɛni.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Zɛ Shɔ Sisɨn Tɛttɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Aɗagbete Yesɔ u si a Urushalima yɛ aru yumusinɛ tɛnɛda, shɔzɛ waanɛ i ã sisɨn tɔ au biini aɗagbete i zɛ vibii zaanɛ au pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Ama Yesɔ sisɨn jo rooɓa ai biini ɓa, aru zɛi sisɨn tɛttɔ kpai. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Ji kasiɓa nɛ shɔwɔu u gelin ruu wɔɔ a shɔzɛ yuuni ɓa, aru gbete u au yuu zɛ vigbete ai sɨsɨn tɛttɔ.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ A Nikodimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Yupɛ̃ni Yahudawa wɔɔ siɗɔn u nii nɛ Nikodimu, si ɓasiyuu a Farasiyayi ni a ɗɔzɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Lewɔɔ yɛ Yesɔ ɗɔbii a zɨmba a geliunɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔmala, u zɛtɛttɔ a shɔ shɔvi matinɛ gbete Ɗalapa shoyɛ. Shɔwɔɔ yɛ zɛnɔɔ vibiizaanɛ gbete akɛ pɛlinɛm ɓa see shɔ gbete Ɗalapa a wuniyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesɔ kasinyanɛ, &lt;&lt;N gelɔɔm pɛ nizɛ: shɔwɔɔ yɛ zɛ Ɗa kpati roonɛ ɓa setɛ shɔ yeeu sɔ̃n tɛttɔ .&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodimu hɨ Yesɔ nɛ, Shɔ gbete batɛtɔ shɔ yeeu sɔ̃n kɛpikoviya? Yɛ sɔɔ ɓini yɛti kati ɓa ziti nɛ shɔu yeen sɔ̃nrɛ ya?<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesɔ risinyanɛ,&lt;&lt;N gelaami pɛ nizɛ, shɔwɔɔ yɛ to Ɗalapa ɗɔɔ kpati roonɛ ɓa setɛ shɔ yeeutɛ mii a Suru. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Vigbete shɔzɛ kɛ yeenɛ ji shɔzɛ, vigbete suru kɛ yeenɛ ji Suru. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Ama vim ukɔ ɔ̃raanɛ vibii zaanɛ aru gbete n gelaa n-tɛ ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ setɛ shɔ yee a sɔ̃ntɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Sɔrɔ shɛrɛ rinɔɔ a ɗɔgbete kasiyɛ, a yɛ ntau gulinɛtɔ, a zɛ ɗɔgbete shɛ a ɗɔnyɛ ɓa ko ɗɔgbete yɛ yɛ-yɛ ɓa, ji nankɔ a shɔgbete shɔ yeeu a Suru yɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodimu hɨ Yesɔ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Vim yɛ ɔ̃ kɛpi koviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Apɛ shɔmala pẽniba a Israila ni, a ji zɛ vim ɓaya? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />N gelaatɛ nizɛ: U sha vigbete u zɛ tɛttɔyɛ, u geli shɔ ji vigbete u nɔɔ zɛyɛ, a shɔnni kpai ɔ ji wesho ɓa au ruum niɓa. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Ɔ ji ã sisɨn ɓa ang biini ɓa a vigbete n gelɔɔyɛ aru vi kootipin ni ɓa; kɛɗɔn ɔ yɛ tɛ vigbete n gelɔɔ aru kolapa yɛ kɛpi koviya? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Shɔwɔ ji yɛ kolapa ɓa lee gbete ɓa, see Shɔzɛja kɔ sheeli, shɔ gbeteu no a kolapa yɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Nagbete Musa tuu sɔɔ lasaka a lapa aɗɔgbete laa ɓa ɗɔm ɓa, shɔyɛ tuu Shɔzɛja ji nankɔ yɛnɛ lapa, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />aru shɔgbete kɛ ã sɨsin nɛ au bi u kpaa Suru gbete sɔ̃nya ɓayɛ.<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Ɗalapa ɔri kootipi waanɛ a ãu jagbete, aru shɔgbete kɛ ã sɨsin nɛ au biini u kpaa Suru gbete sɔ̃nya ɓayɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Ɗalapa ji shou jaa ɓa a kootipi nɛu ɔ̃riu shɔ ruvɔsinɛ ɓa, ama nɛu ɔ̃riu shɔshɔranɛ.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Shɔgbeteu kɛ ã sisɨn nɛ Ɗa jaa bi shɔyɛ gɔ̃u yusho ɓa, ama shɔgbeteu ji ã sisɨn ɓa au bi niɓa, shɔ gɔ̃u yusho ɓɛɛtɛ gboti, aru gbete i ji ã sisɨn ɓa a Ɗa jagbete bi niɓa. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Shom nɔgbete ruu yeenɛ yɛ ɔ̃ yɛ: ɗɔsẽsẽ atɛ kootipi, ama shɔzɛ i kasi ba ɗɔkɨnri tɛɛ ɗɔsẽsẽ tɔ, aruviya i vipɛlinɛ ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Shɔgbete ai pɛli vikɔ̃linɛyɛ kpai i kasi ɗɔsẽsẽ ɓa, i a ɓa a ɗɔsẽssẽ niɓa, aruviya i vi pɛlinɛ ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Ama shɔgbete i pɛli vi tɔ̃vɨn yɛ, i a ɗɔsẽsẽtɔ aru ɗɔsẽsẽ u tasi vigbete i pɛliyɛ tɔ̃vɨn gɨn Ɗalapa nya-ãsitɛ .<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ A Yɔhana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Akɨntini, Yesɔ au jadɔɔyi i yɛ tipi Yahudiya, a ɔ̃ a ɗɔukɔ a yini dɔɔ ziti a pɛli shɔ Batizima rɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yɔhana u si sɔ̃n ji a ɗɔgbete au pɛli shɔ batizima a Aino, ɓa kpɛlɛ a Salima niɓa, aruviya mii si ɗɔu bang. Shɔ au ɗɔbii waanɛ, a pɛliyi Batizima rɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />(Vim pɛlirɛ si shɔ ji ma Yɔhana ɓa jahm niɓa.)<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Yɔhana jadɔɔyi gãsiyi i to nya masinɛ a shɔ Yahudayini nɔgbete i nakoo sãyɛ aru visɔkinɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Kɛɗɔn i yɛ Yɔhana ɗɔbiirɛ i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmala, a kpaa sisɨntɛ aru shɔgbete ɔ si wuni a nya ɓooti Uruduni ya? shɔgbete a nwanya si a yuu niyɛ? U yɛwa u ɗɔ shɔ Batizima pɛlinɛ dɔdɔrim, ko-piya u ɗɔgbete yɛu ɗɔbii yɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yɔhana kasi Yesɔ nyanɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔwɔ yɛ kpaa viwɔɔ ɓa setɛ Ɗalapa ãu tɛttɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Ɔkɔɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete i shi ang knti aru gbete n shanɛ,&lt;N ɓa kirisi ɓa, ama shɔ shong ɓɛɛtɔ n yɛ a ɗekɨn.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Shɔgbete tɛ so ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ suu ɓɛvɔ; Ama ɓɛsa, shɔgbete shi au ɗɔbii u ɗɔ showenɛ, bi yɛ tɔ̃u nyatɔ kɛ nta shɔ so tɛnɛ yeenyanɛ. Jinankɔ n nta binyatɔ̃nɛtɔ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Shɔshɔranɛ vishonɛ yɛ- yɛ ɗekɨnɗekɨn u ɔ̃ kiriri, nkɔ n vishonɛ yɛ sɔ a kɨnti-kɨnti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔgbete Au A A kolapayɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Shɔgbete au a a kolapayɛ ukɔ tɛɛ shɔ gãsiyirɛ kpai. Shɔgbete shɛ a kootipi upɛ shɔ kootipi, yɛ nwanya ji aru vi kootipi, ama shɔgbete au a kolapa tɛɛ shɔtɛ piti kpai. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Sha ji vigbete au zɛyɛ a vigbete ntayɛ, piti shɔni kpai shɔwɔɔ ji tɛu ruum ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Ama shɔgbete kɛ tɛu ruumnɛ kɛ ã ruuba zɛnɛ nɛ au yuuni nɛ Ɗalapa kɔ ɔ̃rɛ tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Shɔgbete Ɗalapa kɛ shounɛ sha ji Ɗalapa nya ruubii, aruviya Ɗalapa ãu suru gbete sɔ̃nya ɓayɛ tɛttɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Jaa ɓeye ɔriu jaa tɔ, u vi piti kpai ãutɛ naa. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Shɔu kɛ ã sisɨn nɛ au jaa biini, yɛ kpaa suru gbete yɛ sɔ̃nya ɓayɛ tɔ; shɔgbeteu ji ã sisɨn ɓa au jaa biini ɓa yɛ kpaa suru ɓa, Ɗalapa sisɨn lɛsinɛ yɛ nɔ au yuu.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ A Su Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ farasiya i ntanyarɛ nɛ Yesɔ kɛ kpaa jadɔɔyi nɛ bang, au pɛliyi Batizima tɛɛ Yɔhana ɓɛɛtɔ <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />(Ama Yesɔ ji pɛli shɔ Batizima ɓa ayuu ɓa; u jadɔɔyi i kɔyi pɛli shɔ ji sheeli.) <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Naa Yesɔ nta vigbete shɔ shalitɛ yɛ, kɛɗɔn yaa tipi Yahudiya a sɔɔ Galili rɛ; <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Au nyaba yɛnɛ ɔ̃kɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ Yesɔ u sɔɔ ɓuzɨn Samariya.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />A ɓuzɨn Samariya arɛ a koomo wɔɔ shɔ ɓaanɛ Sika, ɗɔu si maani a ɗɔ gbete Yakubu ã ɓɛɛ jaa Yusufu si tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />A ɗɔwakɔ Yakubu too mii si ɗɔn, naa Yesɔ yɔɔtɛ a ranɛni, a ɔ̃ a nya too miiukɔ. Si mɛnɛ atette niti.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Su Samariya wɔɔ arɛ nɛn omii, a Yesɔ geliunɛ,&lt;&lt;Ãng mii pɛ n ɓootɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />( Yesɔ jadɔɔyi i yɛ ɓuzɨn koomo nɛi woo vishaanɛ.)<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Suu kasi Yesɔ nyanɛ,&lt;&lt;A pɛ shɔ Yahudawa, nɓɛɛ su Samariya, ivi yɛ pɔ̃rɛ a gaki mii ang naa viya?&gt;&gt;( Yahudawayi i ɓoo mii ɓa a waa gbete a Samariyayi ni ɓa.)<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesɔ kasi suu nyanɛ,&lt;&lt;A si tɔnɛn zɛ Ɗalapa vi ãnɛtɔ, a shɔ gbete gaki mii aa naa yɛni, a si gakiu tɛttɔ, siyɛ ã mii gbete yɛ ã Suruyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Suu geli Yesɔ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmala, a vi mii gɔ̃nɛ ɓa naani ɓa, too mii sɔ̃n a dii gbikiri-gbikiri. A yɛ kpaa mii gbete ã Suru kɛpiya? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />U ɓɛuru Yakubu ukɔ ãu too miimrɛ; ɓoo mii si ji a ɗɔukɔ a ɓɛɛ jaayini au vivaayini kpai. Mɔkɔ tuunɛ nɛn tɛɛ Yakubu tɛ a banɛni, a tɛu tɛya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔgbete i ɓoo miim kpai i yɛ nta sutu sɔ̃ntɔ, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Ama shɔgbete kɛ ɓoo mii gbete n ãu yɛnɛ yɛ nta sutu toti ɓa. Mii gbete ang yɛ ãu yɛ ɔ̃riu kɛ too mii gbete yɛ watiɓa, mii yɛ ɓutɔ aɗɔn u ãu Suru gbete yɛ sɔ̃ nya ɓayɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Suu geliunɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmala, ang miiu pɛjo! Aru n yɛn nta sutu toti ɓa, n yɛn a ɗɔn toti nɛng omii ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesɔ geliu suu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Yɛnɛ a ɓaa mɛvɔu nyarɛ, n ɗaa sɔɔ kɛkn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Suu kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;N ɓa a vɔshɔni ɓa,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesɔ risinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Nizɛ a shatɛ tɔ̃vɨn a ɓa a vɔshɔni ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Shɔzɛ gbete gbete maani ai tɛayɛ, shɔgbete awuni dɔdɔrim ɓa mɛvɔu ɓa. Vigbete a shaɓam nizɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Suu geliunɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmala, n zɛtɛ apɛ janyagadi, <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Mauru Samariyayi i bassi Ɗa si ji a yukɔpɔng kɔ, ama ɔ shɔ Yahudiyayi i shanɛ, shɔ si bassi Ɗa a Urushalima.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesɔ geli suu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ã sisɨn ang bi suum, ɗaa yɛ atɔ gbete shɔ yɛ bassi Ɗalapa toti a kɔpɔ, ko a Urushalimankɔ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Pɛ nizɛ ɔ shɔ Samariya ɔ ji zɛ shɔgbete ɔ basiuyɛ ɓa; Ama u Yahudawayi u zɛ shɔgbete u ɓassiu ɓɛɛtɛttɔ, aruviya shɔshɔraanɛ shɛjo atette Yahudawayikɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Ama ɗau kaanɛ, pɛli tɛttɔ gboti, Shɔ gbete Ɗa Suru kaka a yiniyɛ, i yɛ bassi Ɗalapa tɔ, a sisɨn gbete a Suru, i ãu ji bassinɛ gbete au kasiyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Ɗalapa upɛ Suru, shɔgbeteyi i basiuyɛ ɔ̃riyitɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ i basiurɛ nagbete ɔ̃yɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Suu geliu nɛ, &lt;&lt;N zɛ tɛttɔ kirisi yɛ atɔ, naa kaanɛyɛ, yɛ geliu vitɔ kpai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt; N shɔ gbete n ɗɔ nyanwanɛ a mɔkɔnim, nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ ukɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />A ɗauni Yesɔ jadɔɔyi i sɔɔu ɗɔbiirɛ, i bizaatɔ fɛ̃ɛm a ɗagbete i kpaau a ɗɔɔ nyanwanɛ a suuni. Ama piti shɔmni kpai shɔwɔɔ ji hɨ suu ɓanɛ, &lt;&lt;A kasi iviya? ko i hɨ Yesɔ nɛ, a nwanya piruu ivi a suuni viya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Kɛɗɔn suu yaa jakpari miirɛ, sɔɔ ɓuzɨn koomorɛ, a geli shɔ ɗɔwi nɛ, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />&lt;&lt;Ɔ anɛ ɔ zɛ shɔgbete au gelin vigbete n pɛli tɛttɔ kpai. Ko ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ kirisi ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Kɛɗɔn i yaa koomourɛ i yɛ Yesɔ ɗɔbiirɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Naa ɔ̃tɛ sekaa Yesɔ jadɔɔyi i gakiu rɛ i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔmala, shaa vi pɛtɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Ama a kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;N vishaanɛ ɗɔn gbete ɔ ji zɛ ɓayɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Kɛɗɔn u jadɔɔyi gaa zɔ hɨlinɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ wɔɔ n-tiu vishaanɛ tɛya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesɔ geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;N kɨn, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ n gɨn shɔgbete au shonyɛ nya, n yisi nya vishonɛ gbete au tɔnɛn pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Ɔ nya shalinɛ wɔɔ ɗɔn nɛ,&lt;Rootɛ shɛllɛ nɛ̃ɛ̃ti shɔ yɛ yeekɛ vishaanɛ viya?.&gt;Ama n gelɔɔtɛ, ɔ kɨnnɔɔ pɛ awɔ jaa tɔ̃vɨn; vishaanɛ zɔ̃tɛ, teesitɛ shɔ yeerɛ! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Shɔgbete yee visha yɛ kpaau vi ɗɔnwanɛtɔ, u toli vishau aru Suru gbete sɔ̃nya ɓa; aru shɔ visha ɓaanɛ a shɔ visha yeenɛ i kpai, i ntabiyatɔ̃nɛ a ɗɔzɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Vi shɔ shayɛ si nizɛ,&lt;Shɔ wɔɔ ɓaatɔ shɔ wɔɔ yeetɔ.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />N showɔrɛ ɔ yee visha a jaa gbete ɔ ji shovi ɓa a ɗɔn ɓa, shɔwɔyi i shovi tɛttɔ aɗɔn, ɔ kpaa vi ɗɔnwanɛ kɛjo ai vishonɛkɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Samariyayi i waanɛ i ã sisɨn a Yesɔ bi aru gbete suu shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Gelin vigbete n pɛli tɛttɔ aɗɔn kpai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Naa Samariyayi i a Yesɔ ɗɔbiitɛ, i gakiu rɛ nɛu ɔ̃ ai ikɔyini, kɛɗɔn Yesɔ ɔ̃rɛ a ikɔyini lee ziti.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Shɔ waanɛ i ã sisɨntɔ a Yesɔ bi aru ruu gbete shayɛ, <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />i geli suu nɛ, &lt;&lt; Dɔdɔrim u ã sisɨntɛ, ama ɓa ruu gbete a shayɛ ɓa, u au yuu u nta tɛttɔ, u zɛ tɛttɔ nizɛ upɛ shɔshɔraanɛkɔ a kootipi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Gati Shɔ Yupɛ̃ni Ɓɛɛ Jaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />A knti gbete Yesɔ rootɛ lee ziti a ɗɔuni, yaa ɗɔurɛ a yɛ Galili rɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Arumkɔ Yesɔ au yuu shanɛ,&lt;&lt; Janyagadi shɔ ntau nya ɓa au wɛrɛkooni ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Naa Yesɔ to Galili tɛ, shɔ Galiliyi i tɛu naka ziti, aru gbete i si ji a ɗɔɔ yumusinɛ tɛnɛdani a Urushalimani, aru siyi zɛ vigbete Yesɔ pɛli a ɗɔɔ yumusinɛ tɛnɛda tɛttɔ kpai. <verse eid="JHN 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ sɔɔ sɔ̃n Kana a Galili, ɗɔgbete pɔ̃rɛ mii rikɛ mii inabi yɛ. A ɗɔukɔ shɔ yupɛ̃ni gɔmnati wɔ ɓɛɛ jaa u si vɔrɔ a Kapanahum. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Naa jaau ntatɛ nɛ Yesɔ yuutɛ a Yahudiyani atɛ a Galili, yɛ au ɗɔbii a gakiu rɛ nɛu a Kapanahum nɛu gating ɓɛɛ jaa pɛ gbete au yaa vɔnɛtɛ maani. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesɔ geliu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Awɔ tete shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ ɓa ɗɔn ɓa setɛ ɔ zɛtɛ vinɔlusinɛ a vibiizaanɛ ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Kɛɗɔn Yupɛ̃ni gɔmnatiu risinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Mashɔwɛrɛ, anɛ u yɛrɛ ɗa n jaa vɔyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesɔ geliu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Yɛnɛ, mɛ jaau yɛ gatitɔ!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Jaau ã sisɨnrɛ a Yesɔ nyani a yɛrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />U ɗɔ wɛrɛ yɛnɛ u jawɛrɛyi kpaaurɛ i geliu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Mɛjaau u ɗɔ gatinɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Jaau hɨnɛ jaau gati pi ɗaa koviya, i kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;A si ɓuru dɔɔɗa gbete a niti nɔriu yaunaarɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Kɛɗɔn Jaau ɓeye kpaa sisɨnrɛ nɛ si ji a ɗawukɔ Yesɔ gelinrɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;A jaa yɛ gatitɔ.&gt;&gt;Kɛɗɔn u au shɔwɛrɛyini kpai i ã sisɨnrɛ a Yesɔ biini. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Shɔmpɛ vibii-zaanɛ gbete Yesɔ pɛsii pɛlinɛyɛ aɗagbete sɔɔ a Yahudiya anɛ Galili.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Gatinɛ A Mii Kanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />A kɨntiuni, Yesɔ yɛrɛ nɛn shaa vishaa nɛ yumusinɛ gbete Yahudawayi i shɔ dɔlaa pɛliyɛ a Urushalima. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />A nyejaa mɛrɛ maani, gbete a Urushalima yɛ, mii kanɛ wɔɔ si ɗɔuni, shɔ knti a tali maani, a Yahudawayi nyakoo shɔ ɓaanɛ Besaida. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />A taliu kɔ shɔ yɔ shɔvɔrɔyi ji ɗɔukɔ a shɔ nɔgbãtiyini, shɔ gbete i dɔgbutuyini, a shɔ gbeteyi bi vɔkagbeteyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Aru gbete Ɗajashonɛlapa si alitɔ legbete legbete u guli miiurɛ. Shɔgbete kɛ to miiunɛ a ɗekɨn tɛ̃ɛ̃ti akɨnti gbete Ɗajashonɛlapa gulitɛ, kɛɗɔn ukɔ gatirɛ a vɔrɔ gbete pɛliuyɛni. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Jawɔɔ siɗɔn roovɔrɔ saa bmati atu kopi au jaa maantaa (38). <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesɔ zɛu a ɗɔɔ roonɛ, si zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ jaau pɛ vɔrɔ tɛ̃ɛ̃-tɛ̃ɛ̃; kɛdɔn Yesɔ hɨ jaau nɛ,&lt;&lt;A kasi gatinɛtɛ ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Shɔ vɔrɔu kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Mashɔwɛrɛ, n shɔ tuunɛ gbete n ting yɛti miiyɛ ɓa, aɗagbete shɔkɛ guli mii nɛyɛ ɓa. Nkɛ ntali tonɛ nɛ, shɔwɔɔ torɛ u yang-rɛ a knti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Yulapanɛ, a tuu a siri, a yɛrɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Tɛ̃ɛ̃ti Jaau gatirɛ; a tuu sirirɛ gaa ranɛrɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Lee gbete vim pɛliyɛ si a lee susunɛ, <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi i geli jaa gbete shɔ gatiu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmpɛ lee susunɛ, nya ãsinɛ zãritɔ a tuu a sirirɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />A kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Jaa gbete gatinyɛ ukɔ gelin jo nɛn &lt;Tuu sirinɛ n yɛrɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />I hɨunɛ, &lt;&lt;Jaa gbete gelaa naa tuu siri a yɛrɛ piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Ama jaa gbete Yesɔ gatiuyɛ ji zɛu nii ɓa, moo si ɗɔu bang, Yesɔ bɔkati ai tete ni.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />A kɨntiuni Yesɔ kpaau a wɛrɛ Ɗa a geliunɛ,&lt;&lt;Weshopɛ, a gati dɔdɔrim tɛ; yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛkɛtɔ, aru vi gbete tɛɛ shɔmtɔ yɛ kpaa a rɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Kɛɗɔn jaau yaa ɗɔurɛ a geli yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi nɛ Yesɔ gatinrɛ.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Kɛɗɔn i gaa Yesɔ raatasinɛrɛ, aru gbete nɛ gati shɔ a lee susunɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesɔ kasiyinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Mayɛ shovi shonɛ a lee-lee, n kɔma ɔ̃rintɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ n shovitɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />A rumkɔ Yahudawayi i kã nyaba gbete i nyo Yesɔ yɛ; ɓanɛ aru gbete Yesɔ ka nya ãsinɛ lee susunɛkɔ sheeli ɓa, ama aru nɛ shanɛ, Ɗalapa pɛn ɓeye, a nyabankɔ teesiu yuu a Ɗalapani zali.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗa Jaa Kaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliyinɛ, n gelɔɔm pɛ nizɛ: Jaa pɛli vi ɓau yuuni ɓa; see vigbete zɛ ɓeye a ɗɔɔ pɛlinɛyɛ. Vigbete jaa ɓeye kɛ pɛlinɛ, ukɔma yɛ pɛli ji ukɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Aru jaa ɓeye ɔriutɔ, tasiu vigbete pɛliyɛtɔ kpai, yɛ tasiu vigbete tɛɛ shɔntɛttɔ, ɔ kpai yɛ ɔ̃kɛ vibii-zaanɛ awɔ ɗɔbiini. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Ji nagbete jaa ɓeye yusi vɔrɔ a sàà u ãu Suruyɛ, sɔ̃nji nankɔ jaa yɛ ã Suru sɔ̃njo shɔgbete kasiyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Jaa ɓeye vɔsi shɔwɔɔ ruuɓa, ama ã ɓɛɛ jaa kaka tɛttɔ kpai aru u vɔsi ruu, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />Aru kopiya u bassi ɓɛɛ jaatɔ, nagbete shɔ bassi ɓeye yɛ. Shɔgbete ji bassi ɓɛɛ jaa ɓa si ji bassi ɓeye au shouyɛ ɓa.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />N gelɔɔm pɛ nizɛ: Shɔgbete kɛ weshonɛ ang ruuni u ã sisɨn a shɔgbete shonyɛ biini, yɛ kpaa Suru gbete sɔ̃nya ɓatɔ. Shɔyɛ yeruu ɓa ai yuuni ɓa, ama tɛɛ kaka gbete yɛ vɔtɛ yɛnɛ Suru. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />N gelɔɔm pɛ nizɛ: lee kaanɛ, a tɛttɔ gboti, gbete vɔrɔyi i yɛ nta Ɗa jaa yeenyatɔ, shɔgbete i kɛ ntanɛ i yɛ yulapatɔ a Suruni. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Ji nagbete jaa ɓeye au yuu ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete ã Suruyɛ, ji nankɔ pɔ̃ ɓɛɛ jaatɛjo u ɔ̃ shɔ Suru ãnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Ɗalapa ã ɓɛɛ jaa kakatɛ nɛu yeruu, aru upɛ Shɔzɛja.<verse eid="JHN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Ukɔu ɔ̃rɔɔnɛ vibii-zaanɛ; lee kaanɛ shɔ gbeteyi i vɔtɛ kpai i yɛ ntau yeenyatɔ, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />i yɛ shɛ a sàà: shɔgbete i pɛli vi tɔ̃vɨn yɛ, i yɛ yulapa i ɔ̃ a Suruni, ama shɔgbete i pɛli vi kɔ̃linɛyɛ i yɛ yurɛ Ɗalapa u yeruurɛ ai yuu.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔgeteyi I Nwanya A Yesɔ Yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />N ang yuu n pɛli viwɔɔ dɔɔɓa n yɔbmni ɓa. N yeruu ɓɛɛjo nɔgbete Ɗalapa gelinyɛ. Arumkɔ n ruuyeenɛ pɛ tɔ̃vɨn, aru gbete gɨn ɓa vigbete n kasiyɛ ɓa, ama n pɛli ji vigbete shɔu shonyɛ ãsing nya nɛn pɛliyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Nkɛ nwanyanɛ ang yuu, vigbete n shayɛ yɛ shɔyɛ tɛɛ ɓa nɛ pɛ nizɛ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Ama shɔwɔɔ ɗɔn ukɔ yɛ nwanyarɛ ang yuuni, n zɛ tɛttɔ vigbete kɛ shanɛ ang yuu pɛ nizɛ.<verse eid="JHN 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />A sho jashonɛyi a Yɔhana ɗɔbii, ukɔ nwanyarɛ a yuu ruu tɔ̃vɨn ni. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Shɔ shinɛ akɨnti gbete n pɔ̃ng sisɨng au yuuniyɛ ɓa shɔzɛ ɓa. N sha vim ɗɔkɔ aru ɔ kpaa naranɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yɔhana u si naa pitila, u ɗɔɔ kpɛnɛ u ɗɔ kɔlinɛ, ɔ pɔ̃ sisɨn si tɛttɔ nɛi nta tɔ̃vɨn tɔ au ɗɔsẽsẽni.<verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Ama n shɔ shinɛ ang knti gbete nwanya ang yuu au tɛɛ shɔ gbete Yɔhana sha ang yuu aɗɔn: vigbete n pɛliyɛ, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ, vishonɛ gbete mayɛ ãng nɛn pɛliyɛ, ukɔ nwanyajo ang yuuni, u ntasinɛ mayɛkɔ shonrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Mayɛ gbete shonyɛ ukɔma nwanyatɛ ang yuuni. Ɔ ji ntau yeenya ɓa lee gbete ɓa, ɔ ji zɛu nɔɔkɨn ɓa lee gbeteni ɓa, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />U ruuɓa ɔ ji pɔ̃ ɓa awɔ sisɨn niɓa, aruukɔ ɔ ji ã sisɨn ɓa, a shɔgbete au shouyɛ biini ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Ɔ ɓali Ɗanyaruubiitɛ, aruukɔ ɔ tee a sisɨn nɛi yɛ kpaa Surugbete sɔ̃nya ɓayɛtɔ. Ɗa-nyaruubii gbete ɔ ɓalimi nwanyajo ang yuukɔǃ <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />A shomni kpai ɔ ji kasi anɛ ɓa ang ɗɔbiini aru ɔ kpaa Surukɨn ɓa.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />&lt;&lt;N ji kã ɓa nɛ shɔzɛ i bɛlintɔ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Ama n zɛ ɔ ruubii tɛttɔ, n zɛ tɛttɔ ɔ ɔrinɛ Ɗalapa ɓa awɔ sisɨn niɓa. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />N apɛ a kaka gbete mayɛ ãng yɛ, ama ɔ ji tɛn naa ɓa; naa shɔwɔɔ kaanɛ ji au kaka, ɔ yɛ tɛu naatɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Ɔ kasi nɛyi kpaa bɛlinɛ a zɔ ɗɔbii, ama ɔ ji nta bɛlinɛ au shɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii kãnɛ ɓa, ukɔ gbete sheeli, ɔ yɛ ã sisɨn kɛpikovi ang biini viya?<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />&lt;&lt;Ama ɔkɔɔ sɨnɛ a sɨsɨn nɛn n yɛ wilɔɔtɔ a mayɛ naani. Shɔgbete ɔ pɔ̃ sɨsɨn au biiniyɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Musa, ukɔ yɛ wilɔɔrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Ɔkɛ ã sɨsin nɛ nizɛ a Musa biini, ɔ si ã sisɨntɛjo ang biini, aruviya Musa bee vi tɛttɔ ang yuuni. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Ama ɔ ji ã sisɨn ɓa a vigbete beeyɛ niɓa, ɔ yɛ ã sisɨn kɛpikovi a vigbete n shayɛ ni viya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Shaari Shɔ Laa Ziti Atu kopi Ɓa Maani (5,000)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />A kɨntiuni Yesɔ yɛkɛ tɛnɛ da nyaɓooti wapo Galili, gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ (Tibariya). <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Moo waanɛ i gɨu knti aru vibii-zaanɛ gbete au pɛliyɛ aɗagbete gati shɔvɔrɔyiyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yesɔ gẽ yukɔpɔ lapa a ɔ̃ ɗɔukɔ au jadɔɔyini. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Si ɗaa vishaanɛ yumusinɛ tɛnɛda atɛ maani. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesɔ kɨnnɔɔ a zɛ mɔɔyi kaanɛ waanɛ au ɗɔbii, kɛɗɔn hɨ Filibu nɛ,&lt;&lt;U yɛ wo vishaanɛ pi ɗɔpiya a ã moo mirɛ i shaarɛ piya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />(Yesɔ shavim aru u nta Filibu sisɨn; si Yesɔ au sisɨn zɛ vigbete yɛ pɛliyɛ tɛttɔ.) <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filibu kasi Yesɔ nyanɛ,&lt;&lt;Ko saa shɛlɛ maangbete yɛ teesi shomiyi i vishaanɛ worinɛ ɓa gbete kopiya yɛ kpaa jafɛ̃ɛ u shaarɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Shɔzɛ gbete wɔɔ au tete jadɔɔ u nii nɛ Anduru, Siman Bituru ɓɛzɔ̃, geli Yesɔ nɛ, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />&lt;&lt;Jajjawɔ u yɛmi u a borodi ni maani a jazɨng ni ziti, ama yɛ tɛsi shɔ wɔmɓa piti niɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />&lt;&lt;Yesɔ geliu jaɗɔɔyi nɛ, ɔ geli shɔwinɛ i ɔ̃ tipi.&gt;&gt;(Ɗɔu sijo wisikɔ sheeli.) Shɔwi i ɔ̃rɛ piti kpai, shɔgbete i ɔ̃ ɗɔuyɛ, shɔ vɔshɔ i mɛnɛ laa ziti atu kopi au jaa maani ɓa maani (5,000.) <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesɔ tu borodi rɛ, a gaki Ɗa, a vɔsi shɔgbete i ɔ̃li ɗɔwiyɛ. Pɛli sɔ̃njo nankɔ a jazɨng ni, i kpai i shaarɛ naa i kasiyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Naa shɔwi shaa borodi tɛ tɛsiyitɛ, kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliu jadɔɔyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ toli u dalinɛ gbete yaayɛtɔ, aru yɛ lɛsirɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Naa Yesɔ jaɗɔɔyi toli borodi dalinɛrɛ, i yiki ɓuti kopi atu ziti gbete yaa yɛ.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Akɨnti gbete moo i zɛ vibii-zaanɛ gbete Yesɔ pɛliyɛtɛ, kɛɗɔn shɔgbete i si ɗɔuniyɛ i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Nizɛ kɔ shɔmkɔ ɔ̃rɛ janyagadi gbete yɛ a kootipiukɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Si Yesɔ zɛi sisɨn tɛttɔ nɛi kasin sãnɛ aru u ɔ̃riikɛ kpati a kakabi; Kɛɗɔn a sɔɔ sɔ̃nkɛ yukɔpɔ ɗɔgbete yɛ ɔ̃ yɔbm.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Ra Ayuu Mii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Naa nɔɗarɛ pɛlitɛ Yesɔ jadɔɔyi i yɛkɛ nya ɓooti mii wapo, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Yesɔ jaɗɔɔyi i to yɛti latosi rɛ, i tɛɛkɛ nya ɓooti a ka Kapanahum. Ɗɔtɔɔrɛ si Yesɔ ji a ɓa ai ɗɔbii niɓa. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Kɛɗɔn sɔrɔɔ dusirɛ gãgãni miiu ɔ̃kɛ vibii-zaanɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Yesɔ jadɔɔyi i ra a latosi a yɛti mii mɛnɛ kilomita maani yɛnɛ maangbete, i zɛ Yesɔ u a ɗɔranɛ a yuumii naa atɛ ai ɗɔbiini maani a latosini, i kpai bizaitɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Yesɔ geliyinɛ,&lt;&lt;Bi-ukɔ zaa-ɔnɛ, Pɛ nkɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ jaɗɔɔyi i tu Yesɔ yɛnɛ yɛti latosi, kɛɗɔn tɛ̃ɛ̃ti naa latosiu to tipi gbete i kasi yɛnɛ tɛyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Kã Yesɔ Ɗɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Kɛ dii ɓuru, moo gbete i si a tɛnɛ nya ɓooti wapo da i kpaasisɨn nɛ latosi si ɗɔu gbete. I zɛ ttɛtɔ nɛ Yesɔ ji toɓa a ɗɔnni au jadɔɔyini ɓa, ama u jadɔɔyi ji yaa ɗɔuɓa awuni a nyazɔɓa. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Kɛɗɔn latosi wɔɔyi i shɛ a tipi Tibariya i shi maani a ɗɔgbete mɔɔyi i shaa borodi yɛ, a knti gbete Uɓeyelapa dɔ̃ri Ɗa au yuuni. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Naa mooyi i zɛtɛ Yesɔ u ɓa yɛti latosi au jadɔɔyini ɓa, kɛɗɔn i to latosiwirɛ i yɛkɛ Kapanahum nɛi kã Yesɔ ɗɔ.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Ukɔ Vishaanɛ Gbete Ã Suruyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Naa mooyi i kpaa Yesɔ tɛ a tɛnɛ nyaɓooti wapo da, i hɨunɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmala, a a ɗɔm pi ɗaviya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesɔ kasiyinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;N gelɔɔm pɛ nizɛ: ɔ kãn ɗɔ aru gbete ɔ shaa vishaanɛ wɔsɔ̃n aru vigbete ɔ kasi kpaanɛyɛ, ɓanɛ aru ɔ zɛ ruu vibii-zaanɛ gbete n pɛliyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Ɔkɔɔ shovinɛ aru vishaanɛ gbete yɛ lɛsiyɛ kãnɛ; ama ɔ shovi shonɛ aru vishaanɛ gbete ã Suru au sɔ̃nya ɓayɛ. Shɔmkɔ ɔ̃rɛ vishaanɛ gbete Shɔzɛja yɛ ãwɔ yɛ, aru ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete Uɓeye, Ɗalapa, yaasiu nyaba nɛu pɛli nankɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Kɛɗɔn i hɨunɛ,&lt;&lt;U yɛ pɛlikɛ ivi gbete a Ɗalapa kasinɛu pɛliyɛ viya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Vigbete Ɗalapa kasinɛ u pɛliyɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ nɛu ã sisɨn a shɔ gbete au shouyɛ bi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />I risi Yesɔ nyanɛ,&lt;&lt;A yɛ pɛlikɛpi vibii-zaanɛ gbete pi, u zɛrɛ nɗa u ã sisɨn kɛkn aa biini viya? A pɛlikɛ iviya? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />U ɓɛuruyi i shaa vishaanɛ wɔɔ shɔ ɓaanɛ manna aɗɔgbete laa ɓa ɗɔn ɓayɛ, ji naa gbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ nɛ,&lt;Ãyi vishaanɛ a kolapa aru nɛi shaatɔ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesɔ shanɛ&lt;&lt;N gelɔɔm pɛ nizɛ,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Vigbete Musa ãwɔyɛ siɓa vishaanɛ au shɛ a kolapa ɓa; ɓɛjo maye kɔ ãwɔ vishaanɛ gbete shɛ a kolapa rɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Vishaanɛ gbete Ɗalapa ãyɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete nɔ a kolapa a ã Suru a kootipi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />I hɨunɛ Shɔmala, &lt;&lt; Ãu pɛ vishaanɛnkɔ a lee-lee.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesɔ geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ vishaanɛ gbete ã Suruyɛ, shɔgbete i kaanɛ ang ɗɔbii i yɛ nta wɔ̃ tɔɓa; shɔgbeteyi i kɛ ã sisɨnnɛ ang bi, i yɛ nta sutu tɔɓa. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Dɔdɔrim, n gelɔɔtɛ ɔ zɛn tɛttɔ, ama ɔ ji ã sisɨn ɓa ang biini ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Shɔgbete mayɛ ãng yɛ i yɛ ang ɗɔbiitɔ. N yɛn yiki shɔgbete i ang ɗɔbiiyɛ ɓa, <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Aru n ji a ɓa a kolapa n pɛli vigbete n kasi pɛlinɛyɛ ɓa, ama n pɛli vigbete shɔu shongyɛ nɛn pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Shɔmpɛ vigbete shɔu shonyɛ nɛn pɛliyɛ, nɛn n kɔ loki shɔwɔnɛ a tete shɔgbete au angyɛni, ama nɛn yusiyi lapa a lee gbete kooyɛ sɔ̃nyayɛ a Suruni kpai. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Vigbete mayɛ kasi nɛn pɛliyɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ, shɔ gbeteyi ikɛ zɛ ɓɛɛ jaanɛ, ikɛ ã sisɨn nɛ au biini, i kpaa Suru gbete yɛ sɔ̃nya ɓayɛ. N yɛn yusiyi lapatɔ a lee gbete koo yɛ sɔ̃nyayɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Kɛɗɔn Yahudawayi i gaakɛ nyawowo a Yesɔ yuu, aru shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Nkɔ vishaanɛ gbete nɔ a kolapayɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Kɛɗɔn i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Jaami Yesɔ Yusufu ɓɛɛ jaa, ɓa ukɔ ɓaya? U zɛ ɓɛyɛ tɛttɔ a ɓini ni. Yɛ sha kɛpikovi nɛn nɔ a kolapa viya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesɔ kasiyinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ yaa nyawowo nɛ awɔ nɔni. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Shɔwɔ yɛ ang ɗɔbii ɓa, setɛ ɔ̃tɛ mayɛ gbete au shong yɛ ukɔ n-tiurɛ ang ɗɔbii; n yɛn yusiyi lapatɔ a lee gbete koo yɛ sɔ̃nyayɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Janyagadiyi i beenɛ,&lt;Kopiya Ɗalapa yɛ matiu virɛ.&gt;Shɔgbete kɛ weshonɛ a mati vi a ɓeye bi yɛ atɔ ang ɗɔbiini. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Shom ji tasiɓa nɛ Shɔwɔ zɛ ɓeyetɛ ɓa, shɔ gbete shɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, ukɔ shee zɛ ɓeye rɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />N gelɔɔtɛ nizɛ: shɔgbete kɛ ã sisɨn nɛ kpaa Suru gbete sɔ̃nya ɓayɛtɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Nkɔ vishaanɛ gbete ã Suruyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Ɔ ɓɛuruyi i shaa vishaanɛ gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ manna a ɗɔgbete laa ɓa ɗɔnɓayɛ, ama i vɔrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Ama vishaanɛ gbete nɔ a kolapa, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vishaanɛ gbete kopiya kɛ shaanɛ yɛ ɔ̃ a suruni dangdang. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Nkɔ vishaanɛ gbete u Suru ɗɔn au nɔ a kolapa, Shɔu kɛ shaa vishaanɛmnɛ yɛ ɔ̃ a suruni dangdang, vishaanɛ gbete n ãuyɛ pɛ n yɔpɔ, gbete n yɛn ãrɛ aru koo u kpaa suru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Kɛɗɔn Vim lɛsi Yahudawayi i sisɨnrɛ waanɛ i gaa nya masinɛrɛ ai nɔɔ, i hɨnɛ&lt;&lt;Jaam yɛ ãu u yɔpɔbii pikovi nɛu shaarɛ viya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesɔ geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt;N gelɔɔm pɛ vi nizɛ: Ɔ ji shaa shɔzɛja yɔpɔbii ɓa a ɓoou kpaarɛ ɓa, ɔ Suru yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa biini ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Shɔ gbete kɛ shaang yɔpɔbiinɛ, kɛ ɓong kpaanɛ yɛ kpaa Suru gbete sɔ̃nya ɓayɛtɔ, n yɛn yusiyiu lapatɔ a lee gbete koo yɛ sɔ̃nyani. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />N yɔpɔbii ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vishaanɛ nizɛ ang kpaa ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ viɓonɛni nizɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Shɔ gbeteyi ikɛ shaang yɔpɔbiinɛ ikɛ ɓong kpaanɛ i yɛ ɔ̃ ang yɛti, n yɛn ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo ai yɛti. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Maye gbete u a Suruniyɛ ukɔ shɔngrɛ, a ruukɔ n sɔ̃njo a Suruni. Sɔ̃njo nankɔ shɔu kɛ shaang nɛ yɛ ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo a Suruni ang yuu. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Shɔmkɔ, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vishaanɛ gbete shɛ a kolapayɛ; ɓa naa vishaanɛ gbete mɛuruuyi shaayɛ ɓa. A kɨntiuni i vɔrɛ, ama shɔgbete ikɛ shaa vishaanɛ i yɛ ɔ̃ a Suruni dangdang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesɔ sha vim aɗagbete mati shɔvi a Yahudawayi i ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ a Kapanahum.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruu Suru Gbete Sɔ̃nya Ɓayɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Yesɔ shɔ gɨnnɛyi i waanɛ naa i nta vim i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Vimatinɛm laki bang. Piyɛ weshopi ɗɔn piya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Shɔwɔɔ ji geli Yesɔ ɓa, ama zɛtɔ nɛi masinyajo aru vigbete shaukɔ, kɛɗɔn a geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;Vimatinɛnkɔ pɔ̃rɛ ɔ sisɨn ãnɛ sɔɔ kɨnti ya? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Shɔu tɔpɛnɛ ɔ zɛ Shɔzɛja u ɗɔɔ sɔɔnɛ yɛnɛ ɗɔgbete u si ɗɔnyɛ fa? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Vigbete ã shɔ Suru yɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Ɗa Suru ; shɔzɛ kaka ɓa viwɔɔ ɓa. Ruugbete n gelɔɔyɛ n ti shɔ Ɗa Suru. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Ama awɔ tetem shɔwɔyi i ji ã sisɨn ɓa.&gt;&gt;(Yunɛ aɗagbete vi gaa yɛ, si Yesɔ zɛ shɔ gbeteyi i ji ã sisɨn ɓa tɛttɔ, a shɔ gbeteyi i yɛ mɛliuyɛ ni.) <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Kɛɗɔn a sha sɔ̃nnɛ,&lt;&lt;Arumkɔ n gelɔɔ n-tɛ, shɔwɔɔ yɛ ang ɗɔbii ɓa, see shɔ gbete maye pɛliu nyabarɛ nɛu ɔ̃ nankɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Arumkɔ, shɔ gbeteyi gɨn Yesɔ waanɛ i sɔɔ akɨnti i ji yɛ toti awuni ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ hɨ u jadɔɔyi kopi atu ziti nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔkɔɔma ɔ kasi sɔnɛtɛjiya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Siman Bituru kasiunya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa, u yɛ yɛkɛpi ɗɔbii piya? Mɔkaa shɔ gbete ã shɔ ruu Suru gbete sɔ̃nya ɓayɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />U zɛtɛ u ã sisɨn tɛttɔ mɔkaa pɛ shɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ gbete shɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbiiyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesɔ risinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;N lɔɔ ɔ kopi atu ziti, n ji pɛli ɓaya? Ama shɔzɛ gbete awɔ tete pɛ japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ǃ &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yesɔ nwanyam a Yahuza yuu, Siman Isikariyoti ɓɛɛ jaa. Yahuza u siji atette Yesɔ jadɔɔyi kopi atu zitini, ama ukɔ yɛ mɛliurɛ.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ A Ɓɛzɔ̃yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />A kɨntiuni, Yesɔ raki a Galili; ama ji kasi tɔɓa nɛn ra a tipi Yahudiyani ɓa, aru yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi gbete i a ɗɔu i kasiu nyoutɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Si Yahudawayi i ɗaa yumusinɛ taaliyi pɛlitɛ maani, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ ɓɛzɔ̃yi i geliu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Yaa ɗɔmnɛ a yɛ tipi Yahudiya, nɔgbete a shɔ gɨnnɛyi i zɛa vi pɛlinɛ pɛjo. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Shɔgbete kasinɛ shɔu zɛntɔ waanɛ, yɛ ɓusi u vipɛlinɛ ɓa. Nɔgbete akɛ pɛli vimnɛ, a tasaa yuujo shɔu zɛa a koo kpaiǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />( Ko Yesɔ ɓezɔ̃yima i ji ã sisɨn ɓa au biini ɓa.)<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesɔ geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;N ɗaa ji a pɛ̃nɛ̃ɓa. Ama awɔ ɗɔbii Ko-pi ɗagbete piya ɓɛɛjo ɔ ɓɛɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Kotipi yɛ bɛ̃ɛ̃ ɔ ɓa, ama bɛ̃n ɓɛɛtɛ, aru gbete n ɗɔɔ i ruuvini gelinɛ gbete i pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Ɔ yɛ ɗɔɔ yumusinɛutɔ ɓɛjitɔ. N yɛn yɛ ɗɔɔ yumusinɛm ɓa, n ɗaa ji pɛli pɛ̃nɛ̃ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Yesɔ sha vim, kɛɗɔn a ɔ̃ ɓɛɛjo a Galili.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ A Ɗɔɔ Yumusinɛ Taaliyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Akɨnti gbete Yesɔ ɓɛzɔ̃yi i yɛ ɗɔɔ yumusinɛutɛ, kɛɗɔn Yesɔ yɛ sɔ̃n jirɛ; ama bãlitɔ shɔ ji zɛuɓa piti ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi i si au ɗɔɔ kãnɛ a ɗɔɔ yumusinɛuni. i hɨnɛ,&lt;&lt;Yesɔ u piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Atette mɔɔyi si shɔ ɗɔgbete shɔ nwalinya a Yesɔ yuu a nyawere tot-tot, shɔwɔɔ i shalinɛ,&lt;&lt; U pɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn,&gt;&gt; Wɔyi sha sɔ̃njinɛ ɓa nankɔ ɓa u pɛ &lt;&lt;Shɔ-shɔ ɗakinɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Ama shɔwɔɔ ji shaɓa a kakani nɔgbete shɔyɛ nta piti ɓa, aru i nta seti yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Naa shɔ pɛli yumusinɛutɛ yɛtɛ atette kɛɗɔn Yesɔ to wɛrɛ Ɗa rɛ a gaa shɔ vi matinɛrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Ɔ̃ri yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi kɛ vi bizaanɛ waanɛ i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Jaam zɛ vi tɛttɔ waanɛ shɔ ji matiu vi sɔ̃nɓa shɛ̃ɛ̃ɓangkaa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesɔ kasiyinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Vigbete n matiwɔmi ɓa n vimatinɛ ɓa, ama shɛ a Ɗalapa nya, shɔgbete shongyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Shɔu kɛ kasinɛ nɛn pɛli vigbete Ɗalapa kasiyɛ, yɛ zɛtɔ n vimatinɛ shɛ a Ɗalapa nya, ama ji shɛ ɓa ang nya ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Shɔgbete kɛ mati shɔ vinɛ au kaka bi si kã ɓɛɛji u yuu bassinɛ. Ama shɔgbete kɛ kãri bassinɛ nɛ shɔgbete shouyɛ, u pɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn, nyazɔ̃ ɓa au biini ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Musa ãwɔ nya ãsinɛtɛ, ji ãwɔ ɓaya? Ama ɔ ji gɨn nya ãsinɛm ɓa awɔ teteni ko gbete niɓa. Ɔ kang nyɔnɛ aru iviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Moowi i kasinya i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;A suru kɔ̃linɛ a biini! Shɔu kãa nyɔnɛ piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ kasiyinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;N pɛli vi bizaanɛ gbete, ɔ kpai bi zaawɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musa ãsɔɔ nya aru jaa shaa yeerinɛ, (ɓa Musa ɓa, ama pɛ mɛuruyi i gaa rɛ), piti shɔmni kpai ɔ yeeri jaa shaa a lee susunɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Shɔkɛ yeeri jaa shaanɛ a lee susunɛ si shɔ ji ka Musa nya ãsinɛ ɓa, ɔ lɛsi sisɨn kɛpiruvi a nkɔni nɛn gati jawɔ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ a lee susunɛ viya? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Ɔkɔɔ yee ruunɛ a vigbete nɔɔ zɛyɛni, ama ɔ yee ruujo ayuu vi gbete ji tɔ̃vɨn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Kɔ Shɔshɔranɛ Ya?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ Urushalima gãsiyi i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;N ɓa jaa gbete yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi i kãu ɗɔɔ nyɔnɛukɔ ɓaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Ɔ kɨnnɔɔ pɛ! U ɗɔɔ nyanwanɛ a shɔ ɗekɨn, i ji sha viwɔɔ ɓa au yuuni ɓa! Yɛ ɔ̃ ɓanɛ i zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔshɔranɛ ɓaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Shɔshɔranɛ kaanɛ, shɔwɔɔ yɛ zɛ ɗɔgbete shɛ a ɗɔnyɛ ɓa. U kpai u zɛ ɗɔgbete jaam shɛ ɗɔnyɛ tɛttɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Aɗagbete Yesɔ u ɗɔɔ shɔ vi matinɛ a wɛrɛ Ɗa, nwanya a gãgãni a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ zɛn nii tɛttɔ tɔ̃vɨn a ɗɔgbete n shɛ ɗɔn niya? Ama n ji a ɓa ang kaka bi ɓa. Shɔgbete shonyɛ, ɔ ji zɛu nii ɓa upɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Ama n zɛu ɓɛɛtɛ, aru gbete n shɛ au ɗɔbiikɔ ukɔ shonrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Kɛɗɔn i kasiu sãnɛ, ama shɔwɔ ji ɗiu naa ɓa a biini ɓa, aru u ɗaa sijo pɛli pɛ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Ama shɔzɛ waanɛ atette moowi i ã sisɨn au bi i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Naa shɔshɔranɛ kaanɛ, yɛ pɛli vibii zaanɛ kati u tɛɛ jaam ɓɛɛ ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Shilinɛ Nyejaa Shɔ Shoyi Nɛi Sã Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Farasiyayi i nta mɔɔwi i ɗɔɔ nyawere nwanɛ a ɓɛzɔyini a Yesɔ yuu, kɛɗɔn Farasiyayi a shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa i sho shɔ shilinɛ a nyejaayi nɛi sã Yesɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;N ɗagbete n yɛn ɔ̃ a ɔkɔni roorintɛ pẽtẽrẽ, ama n yɛn sɔɔkɛ shɔgbete au shonyɛ ɗɔbii. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Ɔ yɛ kãn ɗɔtɔ, ama ɔ yɛ kpaam ɓa, ɗɔgbete n yɛ, yɛ yɛ ɔ yɛ dɔɔɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi i nwanya ai nɔɔ shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Kasi yɛnɛ pi ɗɔpiya gbete sɨnrɛ u yɛ zɛu ɓa viya? Yɛ yɛng kɛ koomo tipi Giriki ɗɔgbete u shɔ koo i roo aɗɔn, u mati shɔ nyakoo Giriki ya? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Shanɛ u yɛ kãn ɗɔtɔ ama u kpaamɓa, nɛu yɛ, yɛ ɗɔgbete u ɗɔnniyɛ dɔɔɓa. U ruum tasikɛnɛ iviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jaɓooti Au Ã Mii Suru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />A lee gbete shɔ yisi yumusinɛ nyayɛ, gbete ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ dii tɔ̃vɨn pẽniba a yumusinɛuni, Yesɔ yurɛ nwanya a gãgãni shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ gbete kɛ nta sutunɛ u ang ɗɔbii, <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />shɔgbete kɛ ã sisɨn nɛ ang bi u ɓoo miitɔ. Nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ, &lt;Au sisɨn ɓuzɨn jaɓooti mii ãnɛ yɛ zɛɛ miitɔ aɗɔn.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yesɔ sha nyam ayuu Ɗa Suru, shɔgbeteyi ikɛ ã sisɨn nɛ au bi i yɛ tɛyɛ. A ɗauni si Ɗa Suru ji apɛ ɓa, aru gbete si shɔ ji bassi Yesɔ pɛ ɓa.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuu Vɔsinɛ A Tete Moo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Shɔzɛ gãsiyi atette mɔɔwi i nta vigbete shayɛ i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Jaam upɛ janyagadi kɔ nizɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Shɔ gãsiyi i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Uko pɛ shɔshɔranɛ!&gt;&gt;Ama shɔwɔyi shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔshɔranɛ yɛ a ɓa, a Galili ɓa! <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Ɗanyaruubii shanɛ, shɔshɔranɛ yɛ shɛ a Kpati Dauda laduru, shɔyɛ yeeu a Baitalami, koomo gbete Kpati Dauda ɔ̃ ɗɔnyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Moowi i yuu vɔsikɛtɔ aru Yesɔni. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Shɔ gãsiyi i kasiu sãnɛtɔ, ama shɔ wɔɔ ji ɗiu naa ɓa biini ɓa.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi I Ji Ã Sisɨn Ɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Naa shɔ shilinɛ nyejaayi i sɔɔtɛ, shɔlansi jaa Ɗa a Farasiyayi i hɨyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ ji n-tiu ɓa aru iviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Shɔ shilinɛ nyejaayi i kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔwɔ ji nwanya ɓa naa jaamni ɓa gbete niɓa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Farasiyayi i hɨyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ kɔma nisɔɔtɛ ji ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />&lt;&lt;Ɔ zɛ shɔzɛ gbete tɛ atette yupɛ̃ni ko Farasiya wɔɔ gbete ã sisɨn au biini tɛya? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Moo miyi gbete i ji zɛ ruu Musa nya ãsinɛ ɓa, Ɗalapa wiriyitɛ gboti!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Shɔzɛ gbete atette shɔ Farasiya u siɗɔn u nii nɛ Nikodimu, shɔ gbete yɛ Yesɔ ɗɔbii siyɛ. A geli shɔ gãsiyi nɛ, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />&lt;&lt;Nɔgbete u nya ãsinɛ shayɛ, u zɛnɔɔ ruu yeenɛ ɓa a shɔ yuuni ɓa, setɛ shɔ nta ruutɛ a shɔu nyani, nɔgbete shɔ zɛ vigbete pɛliyɛ kɛkɨn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />I kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Nankɔ, mɔkɔma a shɛ ji a Galili kɔya? A zɛli Ɗanyaruubii pɛtɔ tɔ̃vɨn a yɛ zɛtɔ janyagadi wɔɔ yɛ shɛ ɓa a Galili ni ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Kɛɗɔn kopiya yɛ wɛrɛ.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Su Gbete Shɔ Sãu Ɗɔɔ Kpangtang Pɛlinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Kɛɗɔn kopiya yɛ wɛrɛ rɛ, ama Yesɔ yɛ ɓɛɛkɛ kɔpɔ gbete laa zeetung aɗɔnyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />A dii ɓuru gadi zɨɨnkɔ Yesɔ sɔɔ wɛrɛ Ɗa rɛ. shɔ toli nya au ɗɔbii kpai, kɛɗɔn Yesɔ ɔ̃rɛ a tipi a gaa shɔ vi matinɛrɛ <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Shɔmala nya-ãsinɛ a Farasiyayi i n-tiu su gbete shɔ sãu a ɗɔɔ kpangtang pɛlinɛ, i pɔ̃urɛ ai ɗekɨn. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />I geli Yesɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔmala, sum shɔ sãu a ɗɔɔ kpangtang pɛlinɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Au nya-ãsinɛ, Musa ãsinyanɛ ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ shɔ lɔriu a tari u vɔrɛ, a sha ɓɛɛkɛnɛ iviya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />I sha vim i ɗasi Yesɔ tɔ aru nɛn ɗa i kpaau kɛkn a ruu kɔ̃linɛni, ama Yesɔ ɓakirɛ a bee vi a janaa a tipi. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Naa i ɗɔgbete i yɛ ɗekɨn a ruu hɨnɛni, kɛɗɔn Yesɔ yulapa a geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔ gbete ji pɛli ruuvini ɓa ɗɔnni ɓa, ukɔu lɔu ɗekɨn pɛrɛ a tari.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ ɓaki sɔ̃nrɛ u ɗɔɔ vi beenɛ a tipi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Naa i nta ruumtɛ, i yaa ɗɔurɛ gbete gbete, gaa pɛ a shɔ pẽniba bi yɛnɛ shɔ wujayi bi. Shɔ yaa Yesɔ a ɗɔu a yɔbm a suuni i ɗɔɔ shinɛ a ɗɔukɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesɔ yulaparɛ a hɨ suunɛ,&lt;&lt; I kɛ piya? Shɔwɔɔ ji gɔ̃ a yusho ɓaya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Suu kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Mashɔwɛrɛ, shɔwɔɔ ji gɔ̃n yusho ɓa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Nkɔng ma n yɛn gɔ̃ a yusho ɓa, yɛnɛ ama mɔkaa pɛli ruuvininɛ toti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Kɔ Ɔ̃rɛ Ɗɔsẽsẽ A Koo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesɔ nwanya sɔ̃n a Farasiyayi toti nɛ, &lt;&lt;Nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ ɗɔsẽsẽ a koo,&gt;&gt; A shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔgbete kɛ gɨnnɛ yɛ raɓa a ɗɔkɨnrini ɓa ama yɛ kpaa ɗɔsẽsẽ gbete ã suruyɛtɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Arumkɔ Farasiyayi i geli Yesɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt; Dɔdɔrim a shijo ayuu aa kɨnti ni; vigbete a shayɛ ji tasi viwɔɔ ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesɔ kasiyinya nɛ,&lt;&lt; Ko n shijo àng yuu áng kɨnti ni, vigbete n sha ɓam nizɛ, n zɛ ɗɔgbete n shɛ a ɗɔntɛ a ɗɔgbete n yɛni. Ɔ ji zɛ ɗɔgbete n shɛ a ɗɔnni aɗɔgbete n yɛyyɛni ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Ɔ yeeri shɔ ruu ɔ gɨn ɓɛɛjo shɔzɛ vi pɛlinɛ sheeli, n yeeruu ji ɓa a shɔ yuuni ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Ama n si tɔnɛn pɛlitɔ n ruu yeenɛ si ɔ̃ nizɛ, aru gbete n ɓa yɔbm ɓa, maye gbete shongyɛ u a nkɔng ni. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Awɔ nya ãsinɛ shɔ bee tɛttɔ nɛ shɔzɛ ziti i kɛ pɔ̃naanɛ, vigbete i shayɛ ɔ̃tɛ nizɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Nkɔng shijo ang knti ang yuu, maye gbete shongyɛ uku ma shitɛjo ang knti ang yuuni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />I hɨu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Mɛye u piya?&gt;&gt; Yesɔ kasinya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">&lt;&lt;Ɔ ji zɛn nii ɓa, ko maye ɔ ji zɛu nii ɓa, ɔ si zɛn niitɔ ɔ si zɛ maye tɛjo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesɔ sha vim aɗagbete u ɗɔ shɔ vimatinɛ a wɛrɛ Ɗa yɛ, a ɗɔgbete shɔ pɔ̃ ɓari vinaa ãnɛ aɗɔnyɛ. Shɔ ji sãu ɓa, aru gbete u ɗaa sãnɛ si ji pɛli ɓa.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗɔgbete N Yɛ, Yɛ Ɔ yɛ Ɗɔu Ɗɔɔɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliyi sɔ̃nnɛ,&lt;&lt;N yɛn yɛtɔ; ɔ yɛ kãnɗɔtɔ ama ɔ yɛ vɔ awɔ ruuvinini. Ɗɔgbete n yɛ, yɛ ɔ yɛ ɗɔu dɔɔɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Kɛɗɔn yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Tɔnɛ ɗɔgbete nɛn yɛ, yɛ nɛu zɛnɔɔ yɛnɛ ɓa, yɛ nyou yuu kɛtɔya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ ɓɛɛjo shɔ kootipimkɔ ama n a ɓɛɛ a kolapa. Ɔ ɓɛɛjo shɔ kootipimkɔ ama n ɓa shɔ kootipi ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Arumkɔ n gelɔɔkɨn n-tɛ ɔ yɛ vɔ awɔ ruuvinini. Ɔ ji ã sisɨn ɓa nɛn pɛ ukɔng ɓa, ɔ yɛ vɔ awɔ ruuvinini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />I hɨunɛ, mɔkaa piya? Yesɔ kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ji nankɔ vigbete n gaa wɔ gelinɛ yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />N vigbete n sha awɔ yuu aɗɔn waanɛ, n yeruu dɔɔtɔ awɔ yuuni. Ama shɔ gbete shongyɛ u pɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, n gelɔɔ vigbete shɛ au nyayɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />I ji zɛ ɓa nɛ Yesɔ nwariyinya pɛ a ɓeye yuu ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Kɛɗɔn a geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ kɛ ɗee Shɔzɛja nɛ lapa, ɔ yɛ zɛtɔ nɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ piya; ɔ yɛ zɛtɔ nɛ vi kpai n pɛli ɓang kaka bi ɓa, ama n sha ɓɛɛjo vigbete maye ãsing nya nɛn shayɛ kɔ sheeli. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Shɔ gbete shongyɛ u à nkɔng ni, ji yamɓa yɔbmni ɓa, aru gbete n pɛli vigbete kasiyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Shɔzɛ waanɛ gbete i nta Yesɔ a ɗɔɔ vim shanɛ i ã sisɨntɔ au biini.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tɔ̃vɨn Ãnɛ Yɛ Pɔ̃rɛ Ɔ Ranaarɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geli shɔgbete i ã sisɨn au bi nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ kɛ gɨn vigbete n matɔɔnɛ, ɔ pɛ n jadɔɔyi kɔ nizɛ; <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Ɔ yɛ zɛ vi tɔ̃vɨntɔ, vi tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ yɛ pɔ̃rɛ ɔ ranaa weze.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />I kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;U pɛ Ibirayi Laduru, u ji ɔ̃ shɔwɔyi foo ji shãaɓa. Rugbete a shanɛ u ranaa weze u dɔɔ kɛnɛ iviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesɔ geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;N gelɔɔm pɛ vi nizɛː kopiya kɛ pɛli ruuvininɛ upɛ foo a ruuvinini. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Foo u ɓa jawɛrɛ dangdang ɓa. Ama jaa u pɛ jawɛrɛ dangdang. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Jaa kɛ pɔ̃ wɔnɛ ɔ ranaanɛrɛ, ɔ yɛ ranaa weze nizɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />N zɛ tɛttɔ ɔ pɛ Ibirayi laduru. Ama ɔ ɗɔgbete ɔ kã nyaba nɛi nyontɔ, aru gbete ɔ ji tɛng n vimatinɛ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />N a ɗɔgbete n sha vigbete n zɛ a maye ɗɔbiiyɛ, ama ɔ pɛli sɔ̃njo vigbete ɔ nta a meyeyi nyayɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />I kasi Yesɔ nyanɛ,&lt;&lt;Uɓeye pɛ Ibirayi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesɔ risiyinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ si ɔ̃ Ibirayi ɓɛɛ jaa kɔ nizɛ, ɔ si pɛliji vigbete Ibirayi pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Ɔ zɛpɛ n shɔ gbete n gelɔɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete n nta a Ɗalapa nya, ɔ ɗɔgbete ɔ kã nyaba nɛi nyontɔ. Ibirayi ji pɛli ji nankɔ ɓa! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Ɔ pɛli ɓɛɛjo vishonɛ gbete meyeyi i pɛliyɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">I kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗalapa au yuu ukɔ Uɓeye sheeli, ukɔu pɛ ɓɛɛ jaa tɔ̃vɨnyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesɔ geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗalapa si tɔnɛn ɔ̃ ɔ Ɓeye kɔ nizɛ, ɔ si ɔrintɔ, aru n a, a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, dɔdɔrim n yɛm. N ji a ɓa ang kaka bi ɓa, ama ukɔ shongrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Ɔ ji nta vigbete n gelɔɔyɛ ɓa ruu iviya? Aru gbete ɔ ma sisɨn ɓa ang nya ruubiini ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Meye ɓɛɛ japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃, vigbete ɔ gɨn yɛ ji vigbete meye kasiyɛ. Gaadijo a ɗekɨn u pɛ shɔyuvɔ-nyonɛ, ji ɔ̃ jo shããni a nyaba tɔ̃vɨnni ɓa, aru gbete u ruwɔɔ ji a vi tɔ̃vɨnni ɓa. Kɛ yeenyanɛ ɓɛɛ au ɗɔbii vi tɔ̃vɨn, aru u pɛ shɔ nyayeenɛ, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ nyayeenɛyi i ɓeye piti kpai. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Ama n shapɛ vi tɔ̃vɨn, aruukɔ ɔ ji ã sisɨn ɓa ang biini ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />pi yɛ tasi pi nɛn n shɔruuvini pɛlinɛ piya? N kɛ shanɛ vi tɔ̃vɨn, aru ivi ɔ ji ã sisɨn ɓa ang biini ɓa viya? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Shɔ gbete apɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, weshotɔ Ɗalapa nyaruubiini. vi gbete pɔ̃rɛ ɔ ji wesho ɓa Ɗalapa ruubiini ɓa, ɔ ɓau ɓɛɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Tɛɛ Ibirayi Tɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />I hɨ Yesɔ nɛ,&lt;&lt; U ji sha si ɓa, vi tɔ̃vɨn ɓaya n-tɛ apɛ shɔ Samariya, rãmã sɔ̃n aa biini ɓaya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt; N rãmã ɓa biini ɓa, n basi pɛ maye, ama ɔ ji basin ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />N ji kã bassinɛ ɓa ang yuu ɓa. Ama shɔ gbete kãrin aɗɔn, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ ruu yeenɛ ang yuu. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />N gelɔɔm pɛ vi nizɛː shɔ gbete kɛ gɨn n vimatinɛ nɛ yɛ ɔ̃ a suruni dangdang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Kɛɗɔn i geli Yesɔ nɛ,&lt;&lt; Dɔdɔrim kɔ nyanwanɛ wɔɔ tɔɓa u zɛtɛ a rãmã a ɗɔnǃ Ibirayi vɔrɛ, janyagadiyi i vɔrɛ, piti shomni kpai a shanɛ shɔgbete kɛ gɨn a vimatinɛ nɛ yɛ ɔ̃ a suruni dangdang. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ibirayi vɔrɛ, a tɔɔkɛnɛn tɛɛ uɓeye Ibirayi tɛya? Janyagadiyi i vɔ sɔ̃njirɛ. A risaa yuu kɛ piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt; Nkɛ basin yuunɛ, n basinɛu yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa viwɔɔ ɓa. Maye ko ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete basinyɛ shɔ gbete ɔ tɔɔnɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ ɔ Ɗalapa. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Ɔ ji zɛu ɓa shãa ɓa, ama n zɛutɛ. N si tɔɔnɛn shanɛ n ji zɛu ɓa, n si ɔ̃tɛ shɔ nyayeenɛ awɔ ɗɔbiini. Ama n zɛutɛ n gɨu nyatɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Meyeu Ibirayi nta sisɨn purutɔ aru u zɛ ɗagbete n yɛ a yɛ; zɛrɛ a nta sisɨn purutɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />I geli Yesɔ nɛ,&lt;&lt; A ji yɛ saa laa ziti atu kopi (50) ɓa, a nɛn zɛ Ibirayi tɛya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesɔ risinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;N gelɔɔm pɛ vi nizɛ, Ibirayi ɓɛɛ yeenɛ, n siɗɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Kɛɗɔn i sii tari nɛi lɔruu awuni, ama Yesɔ bɔrɛ a yaa wɛrɛ Ɗaurɛ.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Gati Shɔgbete Shɔ Yeeu Nɔgbãti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Aɗagbete Yesɔ u si ɗɔɔ tɛɛnɛyɛ, A zɛ jawɔɔ gbete shɔ yeeu nɔgbãti. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Yesɔ jadɔɔyi i hɨu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔmala, pi ruuvini pɔ̃rɛ shɔ yeeu nɔgbãti piya? pɛjo u ruuvini ya ko u ɓini a ɓeye i ruuvini ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;U nɔgbãti ɓanɛ a ruugbete nɛ pɛli ruuvini ɓa, ko ɓini a ɓeyeni nɛi pɛli ruuvini ɓa, ama shɔ yeeu nɔgbãti aru shɔu tasi Ɗalapa kaka vishonɛ au yuu. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Ɗaa dooɗɔnni shɔgbete shongyɛ ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u yɛ ɗekɨntɔ au vishonɛni, ɗɔkɛ tɔɔnɛ shɔwɔɔ yɛ pɛli vishonɛ tɔɓa. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />N kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a kootipi, nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ ɗɔsẽsẽ a kootipi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Akɨnti gbete Yesɔ sha vimtɛ kɛɗɔn a tuli susãri a tipi, a rãã tipi awuni, a sii tipi gbete rãã yɛ, kɛɗɔn a sɔ̃ a jaau nɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />A geliu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Yɛnɛ a sɔɔ nɔkɨn a mii kanɛ Siliyam.&gt;&gt;(Nii mi ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ &lt;&lt;Shonɛ,&gt;&gt;) kɛɗɔn jaau yɛrɛ a sɔɔ nɔkɨn rɛ, sɔɔrɛ u ɗɔgbete u zɛ ɗɔ.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />U shɔnyakãsiriyi a shɔgbete i zɛliu si tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ a ɗɔɔ vi gakinɛ i hɨunɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɓa jamkɔ u zɛurɛ a ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ u gbete gaki vi ɓaya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Shɔ gãsiyi shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Pɛ ukɔ&gt;&gt; Ama shɔwɔyi shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɓa ukɔ ɓa; shɛ zɔɔtɔ awuni.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Ama jaau au yuu shanɛ, &lt;&lt;pɛ nkɔng jaaukɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />I hɨu nɛ, &lt;&lt;A zɛ ɗɔɔ kɛpikoviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />A kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Jaa gbete shɔ ɓaunɛ Yesɔ ukɔ rãã tɔ̃pɔ̃ a sɔ̃ring a nɔyi, a gelin rɛ nɛn yɛrɛ nɛn sɔɔ nɔkɨn a mii siliyam. Kɛɗɔn n yɛrɛ n sɔɔrɛ, ang zɛ ɗɔrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />I hɨ shɔgbete Yesɔ gatiu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Jaau u piya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">A kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;N ji zɛɓa,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Farasiyayi I Hɨli Ruu Aru Gbete Shɔnɔ̃gbãti Gatiyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ n ti Farasiyayi jaa gbete siu shɔnɔ̃gbã yɛ.<verse eid="JHN 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />A lee gbete Yesɔ rãã tipi a tẽẽri jaau a nɔɔ si lee susunɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Farasiya i hɨ jaau sɔ̃n nɔgbete pɛliyɛ a zɛ ɗɔyɛ. A geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;Yesɔ rãã tipi a tẽẽring a nɔɔ, n sɔɔ nɔɔrɛ dɔdɔrim nkɛ zɛɗɔnɛm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Gãsi Farasiyayi i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Jaam ji shɛɓa Ɗalapa ɗɔbii ɓa, ji gɨn nya ãsinɛ dii susunɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Shɔwɔyi shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Pi shɔ ruuvini shɔpi yɛ zɛnɔɔ vibii-zaanɛ nankɔ viya?&gt;&gt; Kɛɗɔn i nya ji a ɓa gbeteni ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Farasiya i hɨ jau sɔ̃n nɛ, &lt;&lt;A shanɛ jam kɔ ɓelaa nɔɔ rɛ, a sha dɔdɔrim ɓɛkɛnɛ ivi a yuuni viya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Jaau kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;U pɛ janyagadi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi i ji ã sisɨn ɓa nɛ jaau si shɔnɔgbãti ɓa, arumkɔ i ɓaa ɓeye a ɓini nya pɛttɔ. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />I hɨyirɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmpɛ ɔ jaa ya? Ɔ tɔnɛ nɛi yeeu nɔ̃gbãti ya?, Zɛ ɗɔɔ dɔdɔrim kɛpikoviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />U ɓini a ɓeyeni i kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;U zɛ tɛttɔ upɛ u ɓɛɛ jaa, u zɛ tɛttɔ u yeeu nɔ̃gbãti. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Ama u ji zɛ nɔgbete shɔ pɛliyɛ u ɗɔgbete zɛ ɗɔ dɔdɔrim ɓa, u ji zɛ shɔ gbete ɓeliu nɔɔrɛ ɓa. Ɔ hɨ ji ukɔ, batɛtɔ nɔgbete yɛ kasinya au yuu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Ɓini a ɓeyeni i sha vim aru gbete i nta seti yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi, Yahudawayi siyi matɛttɔ nɛ shɔgbete kɛ shanɛ nɛ Yesɔ kɔ ɔ̃rɛ Shɔshɔranɛ shɔyɛ nyikiutɔ ai ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛni. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Arumkɔ u ɓini a ɓeyeni i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Batɛtɔ, ɔ hɨu nɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Kɛɗɔn toti Farasiyayi i ɓa jaa gbete u si nɔgbãti, i geliu nɛ, shapɛ jo a sisɨn gbete aru Ɗalapa nii u kpaa bassinɛ!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:24">U zɛ tɛtɔ jagbete gataam u pɛ shɔ ruuvini.<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Kɛɗɔn a kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;ko u shɔ ruuvinikɔ ko u ɓa shɔ ruuvini ɓa n ji zɛ ɓa, vi gbete ang zɛyɛ ukɔ, si n pɛ shɔnɔgbãti ama dɔdɔrim n ɗɔɔ vi zɛnɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />I hɨu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Jaau pɛlaa kɛ iviya? Jaau ɓelaa nɔɔ kɛpi koviya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />A kasiyinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;N gelɔɔ tɛttɔ gboti, ɔ ji wesho ɓa vigbete n shayɛni ɓaya? Aru ivi ɔ kasi ntanɛ sɔ̃nrɛ viya? Mɛnɛ ɔkɔɔma ɔ kasinɛi ɔ̃njo u jadɔɔyi kɔ ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Shɔwiyi i dã jaau i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Mɔkaa pɛ u jadɔɔ kɔ, ama u ɓɛɛ Musa jaɗɔɔyi. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />U zɛ tɛttɔ Ɗalapa nwanyatɛ a Musa ni; Ama jaam u ji zɛ ɗɔgbete shɛ a ɗɔnyɛ ɓaǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Jaau kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt; Vibii-zaanɛ wɔɔ yɛm nɛm! Ɔ ji zɛ ɗɔgbete shɛyɛ ɓa, ama ɓeling nɔɔ sɔ̃ntɛ! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />U zɛ tɛttɔ Ɗalapa wesho ɓa a shɔ ruuvini nyani ɓa; Ɗalapa wesho a shɔ gbete i bassiutɔ nya, i pɛli vigbete Ɗalapa kasi nɛi pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Sãnɛ ɗagbete koo gaa yɛ shɔ ji ntaɓa shãã ɓa, nɛ shɔwɔɔ ɓeli shɔgbete shɔ yeeu nɔgbãti nɔɔ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />See jaam gbete shɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, si ɓa ɗɔkɔɓa si ji zɛnɔɔ vim pɛlinɛ ɓa nankɔni ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />I kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ yeearɛ a barɛ, a yɛti ruuvini, a kãa nɛn matiu vi ya? &gt;&gt;Kɛdɔn i nyikiurɛ a Yahudawayi i ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛni.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nɔgbãti A Suru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Naa Yesɔ ntatɛ nɛyi nyiki jagbete u nɔɔ gatiutɛ, a Yesɔ kpaa jaaurɛ a hɨu nɛ, &lt;&lt; A ã sisɨn tɛ a Shɔzɛja biini ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Jaau kasi Yesɔ nya a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmala, gelin pɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ piya? Nɔgbete n ã sisɨn au biǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesɔ geliu nɛ,&lt;&lt;A zɛu tɛttɔ gboti, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete u ɗɔɔ nyanwanɛ a mɔkɔni dɔdɔrim.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Jaau shanɛ,&lt;&lt; N ã sisɨn tɛ Uɓeyelapa!&gt;&gt;A ta a yugboti a Yesɔ ɗekɨn.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;N arɛ a kootipi n vɔsi ruu, aru shɔnɔgbãtiyi i kpaa ɗɔzɛnɛ, shɔgbeteyi i zɛ ɗɔtɔ i ɔ̃ shɔnɔgbãti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Farasiya gãsiyi gbete i si Yesɔ ni a ɗɔu maani yɛ, i nta vigbete shayɛ, i hɨu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Kɛ aa nya shanɛ u ji shɔnɔgbãti kɔ ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ si shɔnɔgbãti, ɔ ruuvini si ɓa. Ama ɔ tɔɔtɛ nɛi zɛ ɗɔtɔ, ɔ doo a yɛti ruuvini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ruɓusinɛ Ayuu Jagamɛrɛ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;N gelɔɔm pɛ vi nizɛ, Shɔ gbete ji to jaamɛrɛ̃ ɓa a nyejaa ɓa, ama a gẽ a nyaɓa wɔɔ, u pɛ ɓɔɔ a shɔ nyaba zẽnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Shɔ gbete to a nyejaa yɛ, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ jagamɛrɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />shɔ gbete ga nyejaau yɛ, yɛ ɓeliu nyejaatɔ; mɛrɛ̃yi i ntau yeenyatɔ, ɓau mɛrɛ̃yi a nii ni, u n ti ɓilirɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Naa shɛshi ɓilitɛ, tɛsiyi ɗekɨn rɛ, mɛrɛ̃yi i gɨurɛ akɨnti, aru gbete i ntau yeenya tɛttɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Mɛrɛ̃yi i gɨn shɔzati ɓa, ama i yuutɔ au ɗɔbiini, aru gbete i ji ntau yeenya ɓa shããni ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesɔ geliyi kɛ ruɓusinɛ shɔm, Ama i ji zɛ vi gbete shayɛ ɓa.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Kɔ Ɔ̃rɛ Jagamɛrɛ̃ Tɔ̃vɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliyi sɔ̃nɛ, &lt;&lt;N gelɔɔm pɛ vi nizɛ: Nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ nyejaa mɛrɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Shɔgbete i apɛ ang ɗekɨn kpai i pɛ ɓɔɔyi a shɔnyaba zẽnɛyi, ama mɛrɛ̃ ji ntayinya ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Nkɔ ɔ̃rɛ nyejaa. Shɔgbete kɛ tonɛ ang ɗɔbii yɛ ranaatɔ; i yɛ to ɓuzɨntɔ i shɛ ɓili i kã vishaanɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Ɓɔɔ torɛ aru u ɓɔɔ shɔvi, u nyo shɔ, u lɛsi shɔ. N arɛ ɔ kpaa suru, ama ɔ kpayitɔ bang. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Ɔkɔng ɔ̃rɛ jagamɛrɛ̃ tɔ̃vɨn, shɔgbete kasitɛ u vɔrɛ au yuu mɛrɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Shɔgbete shɔ woutɔ, gbete u ɓa jagamɛrɛ̃ ɓa, u mɛrɛ̃ sɔ̃n ɓa, kɛ zɛ ɓɔɔnɛ a ɗɔ anɛ, yɛ yuurɛ u yaa mɛrɛ̃yirɛ; kɛɗɔn ɓɔɔ sã mɛrɛ̃yirɛ a sãtiyirɛ kpai. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Shɔgbete shɔ woutɔ, yuu hak aru shɔ woutɔ sisɨn yɛ kɔu ɓa aru mɛrɛ̃uni ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ jagamɛrɛ̃ tɔ̃vɨn. N zɛn mɛrɛ̃yi tɛ, ikɔma i zɛntɛjo. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Ji naa nɔgbete maye zɛn-yɛ, n kɔma n zɛ maye tɛjo, jinankɔ n zɛn mɛrɛ̃yi tɛttɔ ikɔ ma i zɛntɛ. N kasitɛ n vɔrɛ ai yuu. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />N mɛrɛ̃ wɔyi ɗɔn gbete i ɓa jaamɛrɛn kɔɓa. Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ n yɛn n-tiyitɔ, i yɛ weshotɔ ang nyenyani, i yɛ ɔ̃ a jaamɛrɛ̃ gbete, a jagamɛrɛ̃ gbete.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />&lt;&lt;Mayɛ ɔ̃ringtɔ aru gbete n kasi tɛttɔ n vɔrɛ, anɔgbete n yɛn kpaa Suru toti yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Shɔwɔɔ tɛ n suru ɓa ang naani ɓa. nkɔng ãjo ang kasinɛ. N kaka aɗɔn n ãng sururɛ, n kaka aɗɔn n sɔri sɔ̃nrɛ. Shɔmpɛ vigbete maye ãsing nya nɛn pɛliyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Ayuu rumkɔ Yahudawayi i yuu vɔsikɛtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Shɔ waanɛ i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Yesɔ rãma a ɗɔnǃ U pɛ rangǃ Ɔ wesho au nya aru iviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Ama shɔwɔyi shanɛ,&lt;&lt; Shɔgbete u rãmã aɗɔn nwanya ɓa nankɔ ɓa! Rãmã ɓeli shɔnɔgbãti nɔɔ kɛpikoviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Yahudawa I Bẽẽ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Si pɛ goosi, si yumusinɛ wɛrɛ Ɗa sɔɔnɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ shɔ shaa tɛttɔ a Urushalima, <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />a lewɔɔ Yesɔ u si ɗɔ rakinɛ a wɛrɛ Ɗa a ɗɔgbete shɔ ɓaanɛ Sulemanu taali, <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Yahudawayi i toli nya i kɨntiu atette i hɨu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Yɛnɛ ɗavi a yɛ yaau a yɛti sisɨn ziti viya? Geliu pɛjo vi tɔ̃vɨn: mɔkaa kirisi ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;N gelɔɔtɛ gboti, ama ɔ ji ã sisɨn ɓa ang nyaniɓa. Vishonɛ ang shoyɛ a maye kaka, ikɔi nwanyarɛ ang yuuni <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Ama ɔ ji ã sisɨn ɓa aru ɔ ɓang tete mɛrɛ̃ni ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />N mɛrɛ̃ i weshotɔ ang yeenyani; N zɛyi tɛttɔ, I gɨntɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />N ãyi suru gbete isi nyaɓayɛ, i yɛ vɔɓa dangdang. shɔwɔɔ yɛ raiɓa ang naani ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Vigbete Maye ãn ɓayɛ pẽniba tɛɛ ko iviyatɛ, shɔwɔɔ yɛ raa dɔɔɓa a maye nɔsisɨn niɓa <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />nkɔ a mayeni upɛ gbete.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Kɛɗɔn Yuhudawayi i tuu tari nɛi lɔ Yesɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesɔ geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;N pɛli vi tɔ̃vɨntɛ waanɛ awɔ ɗɔbii gbete maye ãnrɛ nɛn pɛliyɛ; aru shɔpiya ai tete ɔ kasing lɔnɛ viya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />I kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;U ji kasaa lɔrinɛ ɓa a tari, aru vi tɔ̃vɨn gbete a pɛliyɛ ɓa, ama aru Ɗalapa nii gbete a lɛsiyɛ! A ji shɔzɛ weze, ama a ɗɔgbete a risi a yuu Ɗalapa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ bee tɛttɔ awɔ nya ãsinɛ Musa nɛ, Ɗalapa shanɛ, &lt;Ɔ pɛ ɗalapa pɛ̃tɛ̃rɛ̃yi.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />U zɛ tɛttɔ vigbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ pɛ nizɛ dangdang; Ɗalapa ɓaa shɔ ɗɔmiyi nɛ, ɗalapa pɛ̃rɛ̃yɛ̃yi, shɔ gbete shɔ ãi Ɗanyaruubii yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Nkɔng kam, maye lɔng-rɛ, a shonrɛ a kootipi. Kɛpiruvi ɔ shanɛ n lɛsi Ɗalapa nii viya?, aru gbete n shanɛ ntɛ nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ Ɗalapa ɓɛɛ jaa ya? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Ɔkɔɔ a sisɨn nɛ ang biini n ji pɛli ɓa vi gbete maye kasinɛn pɛliyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Ama nkɛ pɛlinɛ ikɔ, ko ɔ ji ã sisɨn ɓa ang biini ɓa, ɔ ã sisɨn kɛnɛ ang vishonɛ kɔ sheeli, nɔgbete ɔ yɛ zɛkɛkɨn nɛ, maye u ang sisɨn, nkɔ ma n a maye sisɨn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Kɛɗɔn yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi i kã nɛi sã Yesɔ toti, ama a ranaarɛ ai naani.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ sɔɔ sɔ̃n nya ɓooti Urdun ɗa, ɗɔgbete Yɔhana gaa shɔ batizima pɛlinɛ aɗɔn, a ɔ̃ ɗɔwakɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Shɔzɛ waanɛ i au ɗɔbiirɛ i ɗɔɔ shalinɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;N gelɔɔtɛ Yɔhana ji pɛli vibii-zaanɛ ɓa, ama vigbete sha a jaam yuu kpai pɛ nizɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Aɗɔwakɔ shɔzɛ waanɛ i ã sisɨntɔ a Yesɔ biini.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Liyazaro Vɔnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Jawɔɔ siɗɔn u niinɛ Liyazaro, u si vɔrɔ a Betani. Betani ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ koomo ɗɔgbete Mariyamu a ɓɛzɔ̃ Marita i ɗɔnyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />(Mariyamu si ji ukɔ su gbete pmri Uɓeyelapa nɔɔ sũrũ-sũrũ a bi a dɔɔni piti a sɔ̃li au suyu, si ji ɓɛnaakɔ Liyazaro u vɔrɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Kɛɗɔn ɓɛnaayi i sho shɔwɔ nɛu geli Yesɔ ayuu Liyazaro nɛ: &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa, mɛsau gbete a ɔriuyɛ u vɔrɔ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Naa Yesɔ ntatɛ a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Liyazaro vɔrɔm a kɨntiuni kpai yɛ vɔ ɓa, ama vim ɔ̃ nankɔ aru shɔu bassi Ɗalapa nii, a nyabankɔ Ɗalapa jaa yɛ kpaa basinɛrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />A shomni piti Yesɔ ɔri Marita tɔ a ɓɛzɔ̃ wujaa Mariyamuni wɔsɔ̃n a Liyazaro ni, <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />ama naa Yesɔ ntatɛ nɛ Liyazaro u vɔrɔ, kɛɗɔn ɔ̃rɛ a ɗɔgbete u si ɗɔnyɛ dɔɔ ziti.<verse eid="JHN 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Kɛɗɔn a geli u jadɔɔyi nɛ,&lt;&lt; U sɔɔ tipi Yahudiyanɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />U jadɔɔyi i kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmala, ji dii zitinkɔ shɔ tɔnɛ shɔ loraa a tari a ɗɔwakɔ; a kã sɔ̃n ɗɔukɔ sɔɔnɛ ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesɔ shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɓa niti gbete dɔɔɗa kɔsinɛ kopi tu ziti ɓaya? Kopiya kɛ ranɛ atette niti kpai kɔdɔɔ ɓa, aru i ɗɔgbete i zɛ ɗɔsẽsẽ a koo. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Ama ikɛ ranɛ a zɨmba i yɛ kɔdɔɔtɔ, aru ɗɔsẽsẽ gbete shɔ zɛ ɗɔɔ ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Yesɔ sha vim a gai gelinɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt;U ɓɛusa Liyazaro roonɔrɔtɛ, ama n yɛn yɛrɛ n yusiu lapatɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />U jadɔɔyi i kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a nɔrɔ Uɓeyelapa yɛ gatitɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yesɔ nwanya ɓɛjo aru Liyazarɔ vɔnɛ, ama i ji zɛkara ɓa, i tɔɔɓɛjo nɛ Yesɔ sha nɔrɔ roonɛ nizɛm.<verse eid="JHN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ hãsiyi ruukɛ baras nɛ,&lt;&lt;Liyazaro vɔtɛ, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />N nta sisɨn purutɛ aru n ɓa Liyazaro ɗɔbiini ɓa awɔ yuu, nɔgbete ɔ yɛ ã sisɨn yɛ. Ama u yɛu ɗɔbiinɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tooma (gbete shɔ ɓaunɛ jabɔ̃) geli ɓɛzɔɔ Yesɔ jadɔɔyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;U yɛnɛ a shɔmalani a ɗɔzɔ kpai, nɔgbete shɔ yɛ nyou jo awuni a ɗɔzɔ yɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Kɔ Ɔ̃rɛ Yunɛ A Sàà A Suruni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Naa Yesɔ to ɗɔutɛ kpaarɛ si shɔ gbã Liyazaro tɛ rootɛ a sàà lee nɛ̃ɛ̃ti. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Yuunɛ a Betani yɛnɛ Urushalima si mɛnɛ kilomita taati, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Shɔ Yahudiya i waanɛ i a ɗɔɔ Marita a Mariyamu nyaavɔ geenɛ aru ɓɛnaa Liyazaro vɔnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Naa Marita ntatɛ nɛ Yesɔ kaanɛ, a yɛu ɗɔɔ kpaanɛrɛ, ama Mariyamu ɔ̃ ɓɛɛjo a yɛti wɛrɛu kɔ.<verse eid="JHN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Marita geli Yesɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;A si ɗɔnni Uɓeyelapa, manaa si ji vɔ ɓa! <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Ama n zɛ tɛttɔ ko dɔdɔrim vi gbete a kɛ gaki Ɗalapa nɛ yɛ ãatɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesɔ geliu nɛ,&lt;&lt; mɛnau yɛ yuu sɔ̃ntɔ a suruni,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Marita risinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;N zɛ tɛttɔ yɛ yuutɔ a suruni alee gadi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesɔ geliu nɛ,&lt;&lt; Nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ yuunɛ a sàà a suruni. Shɔ gbeteyi kɛ ãsisɨn nɛ ang biini ko i vɔtɛ i yɛ yuu sɔ̃ntɔ a suruni; <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />kopiya gbete u suru aɗɔn kɛ ã sisɨn nɛ ang biini yɛ vɔ ɓa dangdang. A ã sisɨn tɛ ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Marita kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Nn, Uɓeyelapa! N ã sisɨn tɛttɔ mɔkaa pɛ Shɔshɔranɛ, Ɗaalapa jaa, shɔ gbete yɛ arɛ a koo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ sɨnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Akɨnti gbete Marita sha vimtɛ, a sɔɔrɛ a ɓaa ɓɛzɔ̃ Mariyamu nya kagbete a geliu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔmala u yɛm, u ɗɔgbete u hɨ a ruubii yɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Naa Mariyamu ntatɛ nankɔ, yulapa a pɛli gbãgbã a yɛu ɗɔbiirɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />(Si Yesɔ ji to jakoomɔu pɛ̃nɛ̃ɓa, ama u si doo ɗɔgbete Marita kpaauyɛ.) <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Shɔgbete i si a ɗɔɔ Mariyamu nyageenɛ a wɛrɛ yɛ, i gɨn Mariyamu rɛ yɛnɛ ɓili naa i zɛtɛ yuu ɓilitɛ gbãgbã. I tɔnɛ mɛnɛ yɛ ɗɔɔ sɨnnɛ a yusàà.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Mariyamu to ɗɔgbete Yesɔ ɗɔnrɛ, tɛ̃ɛ̃ti naa zɛ Yesɔ tɛ, a nwesi au ɗekɨn a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa, a si ɗɔnni manaa sijo vɔ ɓa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesɔ zɛurɛ a ɗɔɔ sɨnnɛ, a zɛ shɔgbete i si aukɔni i sɔ̃nji ɗɔɔ sɨnnɛ; vim ntau a sisɨn gbukut, yɛ feefee u ɗɔɔ lɛrinɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />A hɨyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ gbãu piɗɔpiya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">I kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt; Anɛ a zɛrɛ Uɓeyelapa,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesɔ sɨnrɛ.<verse eid="JHN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Yahudawayi i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ zɛ nɔgbete ɔri Liyazaro yɛ pɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Ama gãsiyi i hɨnɛ, &lt;&lt;Jaam ɓeli shɔnɔ̃gbayi i nɔɔ, ɓa ukɔ ɓaya? Yɛ zɛnɔɔ ɓa u zããri Liyazaro vɔnɛrɛ ɓaya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Yuusi Liyazaro a Suruni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ lɛri sɔ̃n au sisɨn gbukut, a yɛ yusàà rɛ, gbete si nyapuru shɔ kuki tari a nya sààuni. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesɔ ãsinyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ giri tariunɛ kagbete!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Kɛɗɔn Marita shɔ vɔrɔu ɓɛnaa kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Yɛ pmtitɔ dukuduku, Uɓeyelapa. Aru nɛm dii nɛ̃ɛ̃ti gbete u gbãu yɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesɔ geliu nɛ, &lt;&lt;N ji gelaa ɓaya, n-tɛ akɛ ã sisɨng nɛ, a yɛ zɛ Ɗalapa basinɛtɔ ɓaya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Kɛɗɔn i giri tariurɛ kagbete. Yesɔ ɗeenɔɔ a kolapa a shanɛ,&lt;&lt; N dɔ̃raatɛ, maye, a weshotɔ ang nyani. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />N zɛ tɛttɔ a weshotɔ ang nyani ko-pi lee piya, ama n sha vim aru shɔgbete i aɗɔm, nɔgbete i yɛ ã sisɨn nɛ mɔkaa shong-rɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Akɨnti gbete sha vimtɛ, a ɓaa nya a kakani a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Liyazaro shɛ ɓilinɛǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Liyazaro shɛ ɓilirɛ, u naa a dɔɔni shɔ mali tɛttɔ a làā vɔrɔ gbãnɛ, a fãrã ni au nɔkɨn.Yesɔ geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ kaliu nɛ, u yɛrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Maruu a Yesɔ Yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Shɔzɛ waanɛ gbete i a ɗɔɔ Mariyamu nyageenɛ i zɛ vigbete Yesɔ pɛliyɛ, i ã sisɨn tɔ a Yesɔ biini. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Ama gãsiyi i sɔɔ Farasiyayi i ɗɔbii i geliyi vigbete Yesɔ pɛliyɛtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Kɛɗɔn Farasiyayi a shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa wɔsɔ̃n yupɛ̃ni dɔlaa i ɔ̃rɛ i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;U pɛli pikoviya? Ɔ kɨnnɔɔ pɛ vibii-zaanɛ gbete jaam kɛ pɛlinɛ kpai! <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />U kɛ yaunɛ u yɛ ɗekɨn a vimni, kopiya yɛ ã sisɨn tɔ au biini, shɔ Romayi i yɛ lɛsiu wɛrɛ Ɗa tɔ, i tɛu tipi sɔ̃ntɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Shɔzɛ gbete ai tete u nii nɛ Kayafa, u si yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa a saa uni shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ rãng ya! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Ɔ ji zɛ ɓanɛ pɛ vi tɔ̃vɨn shɔzɛ gbete u vɔrɛ, aru shɔ waanɛyi yuu, a yugbete shɔzɛ kpai i lɛsirɛ ɓaya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Nizɛ kɔ, Kayafa vigbete sham ji shɛshi ɓa au sisɨn ɓa ama sharɛ aru si ji ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi a wɛrɛ Ɗa a saa uni, shapɛ vigbete kaanɛ ɗekɨn, nɛ Yesɔ yɛ vɔtɔ a Yuhudawayi yuu, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />ɓa ai yuukɔ sheeli ɓa, ama wɔsɔ̃n u toli shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi nya ai sãtiyɛ kpai ɗɔgbete.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Sãnɛ lee ukɔ yɛnɛ ɗekɨn Yahudawayi i gaa nyaba kãnɛ nɔgbete i yɛ nyo Yesɔ yɛ.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Arumkɔ Yesɔ ji ra tɔɓa a Yahudiya ni a shɔ nɔni ɓa, ama yɛrɛ a ɔ̃kɛ koo gbete shɔ ɓa ɗɔmɓayɛ maani, tokɛ koomo wɔɔ u nii nɛ Efaramu, ɔ̃kɛ ɗɔuko au jadɔɔyini.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />A ɗɔukɔ naa Yahudawayi i ɗaa yumusinɛ tɛnɛda atɛ maani, shɔzɛ waanɛ a jakomɔɔ i yɛ Urushalima aru i sɔɔyi yuu nɛ nɗa dii yumusinɛu yɛ a yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />I ɓɛɛjo ɗɔɔ Yesɔ kãnɛ, naa i toli nyatɛ a wɛrɛ Ɗa, i hɨ zɔɔnɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ zɛ pikoviya? Yɛ a ɗɔɔ yumusinɛ kati ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Shɔlansi a wɛrɛ Ɗa a Farasiyayi i ãsinyanɛ, shɔgbete kɛ zɛ Yesɔ nɛ, ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u geliutɔ, nɔgbete i yɛ sãuyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Shɔ pmri Yesɔ nɔɔ a Betani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Si yaatɛ dii maangbete shɔ to lee yumusinɛ tɛnɛdarɛ, Yesɔ yɛ Betani rɛ, ɗɔgbete Liyazaro aɗɔnyɛ, jaa gbete Yesɔ yusuu a sàà yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Shɔ nwariu vishaanɛ ɗarɛ a ɗɔukɔ, Marita ukɔ pɛli vishaanɛurɛ; Liyazaro u si jo tete shɔgbete i shaa vishaanɛ a Yesɔ ni. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Kɛɗɔn Mariyamu tuu nɔɔ sũrũ-sũrũ au saa yuuni gbete shɔ pɛli a vigbete shɔ ɓaanɛ nard, a tɛ̃ri Yesɔ au dɔɔ, a yɔriukɛ au suyuu. Sẽẽ nɔɔu raa wɛrɛu kpai. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Shɔzɛ gbete atette Yesɔ jadɔyi Yahuza Isikariyoti, gbete yɛ mɛli Yesɔ shanɛ, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />Shɔ si mɛli nɔɔm saa siliva laa kopi tu maani a ã saa u shɔ raayi ji tɛɛ ɓaya? <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Sha vim, ɓanɛ zɛ shɔ raayitɔ ɓa, ama aru u si ɓɔɔ. Si ji ukɔ tuu lazɔrɔ saa jo u ɗii naa a saa gbete a ɓuzɨnni.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Ama Yesɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ shɛ sum nyaɓaǃ Ɔ yaaunɛ, woo nɔɔm aru u pɔ̃tɔ see lee gbete shɔ gbãnyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Ɔ yɛ ɔ̃ ɓɛɛjo a shɔ raayini a lee-lee ama ɔ yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa nkɔng ni lee-lee ni ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ maruu a Liyazaro yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Shɔzɛ waanɛ naa i ntatɛ nɛ Yesɔ u a Betani, i yɛrɛ aɗɔn, ɓa Yesɔ yuukɔ sheeli ɓa ama wɔsɔ̃n a Liyazaru yuu, shɔgbete Yesɔ yusiu lapa a sàà yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Kɛɗɔn shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa i maruu nɛi nyɔ Liyazarɔ sɔ̃njo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />aru ji au ruubiikɔ Yahudawayi waanɛ i yuu vãrɛ i ɗɔgbete i ã sisɨn a Yesɔ bi<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ To Urushalima Naa Kpati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />A dii wɔɔ shɔzɛ waanɛ gbete i a ɗɔɔ yumusinɛ tɛnɛda i ntarɛ nɛ Yesɔ kaa Urushalima nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Kɛɗɔn i tuu nalaa kolinɛ kãkã i shɛ ɓili ɗɔɔ Yesɔ kpaanɛ, i ɗee nyeenya lapa i shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">&lt;&lt;Hosana!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">&lt;&lt;Ɗalapa u tasi shɔ gbete arɛ a Uɓeyelapa nii vɔɔ susãri biini!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">&lt;&lt;Ɗalapa u tasi kpati Israila vɔɔ susãri biniǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Naa Yesɔ kpaa gãtola tɛ a gẽrɛ aɗɔn, ji naa gbete Ɗa nya ruubii shayɛ,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />&lt;&lt;Mɔkaa nta setinɛ, koomo pɛ̃nɛ̃ba Sihiyɔna!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Ɔ kpati kaanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">ɔ̃tɛ yuu jagãtola.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />U jadɔɔyi i ji kpaa vim kara ɓa a ɗauni ɓa; ama akɨnti gbete Yesɔ yulapa a bassinɛni, i kpaa sisɨn kɛkn nɛ Ɗanyaruubii sha si tɛttɔ au ruubii ni, shɔ sɔ̃ri nya vigbete janyagadi shayɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Mooyi gbete i si Yesɔ ni aɗagbete ɓaa Liyazarɔ nya a yusuu a sàà ikɔi sha vi gbete si ɗɔɔ yɛnɛrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Mooyi i shɛ Yesɔ ɗɔɔ naa tɛnɛ a nyaba, aru si nta ruu vibii-zaanɛ gbete pɛli si tɛttɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Kɛɗɔn Farasiyayi i geli zɔɔnɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ zɛtɛ ya, Ɗa ji shaaruu ɓa! Shɔzɛ a koo kpai i au knti!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gãsi Shɔ Heliniya i Kã Yesɔ Ɗɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Gãsi shɔ Heliniya i si jo atette shɔ gbete i yɛ Urushalima aru Ɗa bassinɛ a ɗaa yumusinɛ tɛnɛda ni. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Kɛɗɔn i gɨn Filibu (shɔ Besaida a tipi Galili) i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Mashɔwɛrɛ, u kasi Yesɔ zɛnɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filibu yɛrɛ a geli Anduru rɛ, i ziti piti i yɛrɛ i geli Yesɔ rɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesɔ kasi i nyanɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɗaa pɛlitɛ gbete Shɔzɛja yɛ tɛ bassinɛ pẽneba yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />N gelɔɔm pɛ nizɛ: shɔ ji bu nɔɔ visha ɓatɔ a tipi a vɔrɛ ɓa, yɛ ɔ̃ ji nankɔ, kɛ vɔnɛ, kɛɗɔn rɛɛ jaa kɛkn waanɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Shɔ gbete kɛ ɔriu surunɛ yɛ raariu naatɔ; shɔgbeteyi i kɛ ɓɛ̃ɛ̃yi surunɛ a koo dɔdɔrim, si pɔ̃u surutɛ dangdang, suru gbete yɛ sɔ̃ nya ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Shɔ gbete shoshing vishonɛ kpai ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u gɨn n-tɔ, nɔgbete n jawɛrɛ yɛ ɔ̃ ji aɗɔgbete n aɗɔnyɛ. Shɔgbete yɛ shoshing vishonɛ piti kpai maye yɛ ɔriutɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Nwanya Au Yuu Vɔnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />Yesɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɔdɔrim n ɗɔgbete n nta kpetinɛ ang sisɨn, n shakɛnɛ iviya? N shanɛ,&lt;Maye, mɔkaa yaanɛ ɗaam u arɛ u kpangrɛ ya?&gt; Ama ji ruu gbetenkɔ n arɛ a kolapa anɛ kotipi, aru n tɛ raɓoonɛ a ɗaankɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Maye n ti basinɛtɔ aa nii ni!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Kɛɗɔn yeenya shɛ a kolapa nɛ, &lt;&lt;N n ti basinɛtɛ au yuuni, n yɛn pɛli sɔ̃n namkɔ tɔti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Mooyi gbete i a ɗɔu i nta yeenyaurɛ, gãsiyi shanɛ pɛ jalɛ, wɔɔyi shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗajashonɛlapa i nwanyarɛ awuni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Ama Yesɔ geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt; Shɔ ji nwa yeenyam ɓa ang yuu ɓa ama pɛ awɔ yuu. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Shɔ yɛ yeruu kɛ dɔdɔrimkɔ a koo; kpati kotipim shɔ yɛ zɔ̃u kɛtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Shɔkɛ ɗennɛ a koo n yɛn gɔ̃ shɔzɛ kpai ang ɗɔbii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Naa shatɛ nam, sha raɓoonɛ gbete yɛ ɓoo au vɔnɛyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Mooyi kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;U nya-ãsinɛ geliu nɛ, Shɔshɔranɛ yɛ ɔ̃ a suruni dangdang. Kɛpiru-ivi a shanɛ Shɔzɛja shɔ yɛ ɗeutɔ yɛnɛ lapa viya? Pi ɔ̃rɛ Shɔzɛja piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt; Ɗɔsẽsẽm yɛ ɔ̃ awɔ tete sekaa. Ɔ sã nyaba ɔ yɛrɛ ɗɔsẽsẽ doo aɗɔn, nɔgbete ɗɔkɨnri yɛ kukkɔɔ ɓa; Shɔgbete ra a ɗɔkɨnri zɛ ɗɔ yɛnɛ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Ɔ ã sisɨntɔ ɗɔsẽsẽni, dɔdɔrim ɔ yɛ kpaatɔ, aru ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ ɗɔsẽsẽ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 12:36">Yahudawayi i ji ã sisɨn ɓa au biini ɓa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Akɨnti gbete Yesɔ sha vim, yɛrɛ a ɓukɛtɔ aru moo i zɛurɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Piti nɔgbete pɛli vibii-zaanɛ ai ɗɔbii, i ji ã sisɨn ɓa au biini ɓa, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Vim ɔ̃ namkɔ aru vigbete janyagadi Ishaya shayɛ u ɔ̃ nizɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">&lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa, shɔ gbete ã sisɨn a vigbete u shayɛni kɛpiya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Uɓeyelapa tasiu kaka kɛpiya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Arumkɔ i ji ã sisɨn ɓa, Ishaya sha si tɛttɔ nɛ:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />&lt;&lt;Ɗalapa ɓaariyi nɔɔ tɛttɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">wɔsɔ̃n kukiyi sisɨn tɛttɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">nɔgbete i nɔɔ yɛ zɛ vi ɓa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">wɔsɔ̃n i sisɨn yɛ zɛ ruuɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">i yɛ rii nɔɔ ɓa ang ɗɔbiini ɓa, Ɗalapa sharɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">nɛn gatiyitɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Ishaya sha vim aru zɛ Yesɔ bassinɛ, a nwanya kɛkn a yuuni.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Piti shomni kpai shɔ waanɛ a yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayini i ã sisɨntɔ a Yesɔ biini, ama aru seti Farasiyayi i ji tasi ɓa ɓilini ɓa, nɛ shɔ nyikiirɛ a Yahudawayi i ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛni. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />I ɔri ba bɛlinɛ gbete shɛ a shɔzɛ ɗɔbii u tɛɛ Ɗalapa ɓɛɛtɔ.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruyeenɛ a Yesɔ Nyanwanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ ɗee nyeenya lapa shanɛ,&lt;&lt; Shɔgbete kɛ ã sisɨn nɛ ang bi, ji ã sisɨn ɓang bikɔ sheeli ɓa ama ã sisɨn a shɔgbete shong yɛ bi. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Shɔ gbete kɛ zɛnnɛ, zɛ shɔ gbete shong yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />N arɛ a kootipi aru n pɛ ɗɔsẽsẽ, kopiya kɛ ã sisɨn nɛ ang biini ukɔ ɔ̃nɛ a ɗɔkɨnrini. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Kopiya kɛ ntang ruugbete n shayɛnɛ, ji gɨn ɓa, n yɛn yeruu ɓa ai yuuni ɓa. N ji a ɓa nɛn yeruu a koo ɓa, ama n a ɗɔɔ shɔraanɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Shɔgbete kɛ ɓẽn ruubiinɛ, ji tɛ ruugbete n shayɛ ɓa, shɔ gbete yɛ yeruu ayuu aɗɔn. Nyaruu gbete n shayɛ ukɔ yɛ ɔ̃rɛ i shɔruyeenɛ a lee gadiiǃ <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Vim pɛ nizɛ, nya gbete n nwayɛ ji shɛ ɓa ang kaka bi ɓa, ama maye gbete shongyɛ ãsin nya tɛttɔ a vigbete n nwayɛ ang shayɛni. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />N zɛtɛttɔ u nya ãsinɛ n ti suru gbete yisi nyaɓa, vigbete n shayɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vigbete maye gelin yɛ nɛn shayɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ sɔɔri u jaɗɔɔyi i dɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Lee yumusinɛ tɛnɛda u ɓɛɛ anɛ. Si Yesɔ zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ ɗagbete yɛ yaa kootipi pɛlitɛ yɛkɛ Ɓeye ɗɔbii. Aru Yesɔ ɔri shɔgbete i a kootipim tɔ ko-pi ɗaviya, ɔriitɔ anɛ ɗagbete koo yisi nyayɛ.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yesɔ au jadɔɔyini i ɗɔ gbete i shaa vishaanɛ ɗarɛ yɛ. Si japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ pɔ̃ ruutɛ a Yahuza sisɨn gboti, Isikariyoti Siman ɓɛjaa, nɛn mɛli Yesɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesɔ zɛ tɛttɔ si ɓeye ãu vi tɛttɔ a naa kpai; zɛ tɛttɔ shɛpɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, yɛ sɔɔ sɔ̃n Ɗalapa ɗɔbii. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ yuurɛ a ɗɔɔ vishaanɛni, a zɔ̃u fãrã gbete au si aka ɓilirɛ, a ma taweli rɛ au sãng. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Kɛɗɔn a tɛ̃ɛ̃ mii gbenti a gaa u jaɗɔɔyi dɔɔ sɔɔkinɛ u ɗɔgbete sɔ̃li a taweli yɛ gbete ma au sãng. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Arɛ a Siman Bituru ɗɔbii, Bituru geliunɛ, &lt;&lt;Mɔkaa yɛ sɔrin dɔɔ rɛ ya Uɓeyelapa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesɔ kasiu nyanɛ,&lt;&lt;Dɔdɔrim, a ji zɛ vigbete n pɛliyɛ ɓa, ama a yɛ zɛtɔ ɗekɨn ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Bituru ɓeli nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Yɛ pɛli ɓa, koo, yɛ yisi nyajo weze a yɛ sɔrin dɔɔ ɓaǃ &gt;&gt;Yesɔ kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;N ji sɔɔraa dɔɔ ɓa, a yɛ ɔ̃ toti n jadɔɔ ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Bituru kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa, mɔkaa sɔɔrinnɛ dɔɔ kɔ sheeli, ama a sɔɔrin naani a yuuni kpaiǃ &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesɔ kasi nya a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔgbete weli bitɛ kãu yuu sɔɔnɛ toti ɓa, see u dɔɔyi kɔ sheeli, ɔ kpai ɔ pɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ see gbete.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Si Yesɔ zɛ shɔ gbete yɛ mɛliu tɛttɔ gboti; aruukɔ sha kɛkn nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ piti kpai ɔ shɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, see shɔzɛ gbete awɔ tete.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Akɨnti gbete Yesɔ yisi i nya dɔɔ sɔɔnɛtɛ, kɛɗɔn a tosi u fãrã sɔ̃n bi, a sɔɔ ɗɔɔ vishaanɛrɛ. A hɨnɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ zɛ vigbete n pɛlɔɔntɛ ya? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Jo nizɛ ɔ ɓannɛ shɔmala a Uɓeyelapa, ɔ shatɛ tɔ̃vɨn arumkɔ n ji nankɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ Uɓeyelapa a shɔmala, n sɔɔrɔɔ dɔɔtɛ. Ɔkɔɔ ma ɔ sɔɔri zɔɔ ji nankɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />N tasɔɔ nɔɔtɛ, ɔ pɛli sɔ̃nji nagbete n pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />N gelɔɔm pɛ nizɛ: Fooyi i tɛɛ ɓɛshɔwɛrɛ ɓa, Jashonɛ ma yɛ tɛɛ shɔgbete shouyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Dɔdɔrim ɔ zɛ vi tɔ̃vɨntɛ, ɔ kɛ shovinɛ awuni ɔ yɛ nta tɔ̃vɨntɔ!<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />&lt;&lt; N ji sha ɓa awɔ yuu piti kpai ɓa; n zɛ shɔgbete n lɔyi tɛttɔ. Ama aru shɔ sɔ̃ri nya vigbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ nɛ,&lt;Shɔgbete shaan vishaanɛ riitɛ n shɔnɔ̃pɔ̃.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />N gelɔɔ vim dɔdɔrim n ɗa yɛ pɛliyɛ, nɔgbete kɛ pɛlinɛ, ɔ ã sisɨntɔ nɛ nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ ukɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />N gelɔɔm pɛ nizɛ, shɔgbete kɛ tɛ shɔgbete n shoyirɛ naa nɛ, tɛng naa sɔ̃ntɛjo; shɔgbete kɛ tɛng naa nɛ, tɛ pɛ gbete shongyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ sha vi gbete shɔyɛ pɛliuyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Akɨnti gbete Yesɔ sha vimtɛ kpaiyɛ, nta kpetinɛtɔ au suruni a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;N gelɔɔm pɛ nizɛː shɔzɛ gbete awɔ tete yɛ mɛlintɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />U jadɔɔyi i kɨnnɔɔ a zɔɔ bi, i ji zɛ shɔgbete nwanya au yuuni ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Shɔzɛ gbete atette jadɔɔyi, gbete Yesɔ ɔriyɛ, u si ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ a Yesɔni maani. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Kɛɗɔn Siman Bituru geli jaaunɛ, hɨ Yesɔ nɛ nwanya a pi yuu piya?<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Kɛɗɔn u Jadɔɔu arɛ a Yesɔ ɗɔbii maani a hɨunɛ, &lt;&lt;Piya Uɓeyelapa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete n yɛn ãu borodirɛ a naa n kɛ hãnɛ a pii; pɛjo ukɔ.&gt;&gt; Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ daa borodi, a ã Yahuza rɛ, Siman ɓɛjaa Isikariyoti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Tɛ̃ɛ̃ti naa Yahuza tɛ borodi gbete Yesɔ daatɛ, kɛɗɔn japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ tou birɛ. Yesɔ geliu nɛ,&lt;&lt;pɛli vigbete a nɛn pɛliyɛrɛ gbãgbãǃ &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ama atette shɔ gbete i ɗɔɔ vishaanɛ a wuniyɛ i ji zɛ vi gbete pɔ̃rɛ Yesɔ geliu Yahuza nankɔni ɓa <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Yahuza si shɔ lazɔrɔ saa sãnɛ arumkɔ gãsi Yesɔ jadɔɔyi i tɔnɛ mɛnɛ Yesɔ geliutɛ nɛu yɛrɛ nɛu woo vigbete shɔ kasi a ɗɔɔ yumusinɛ tɛnɛda, ko nɛmɛnɛ geliutɛ nɛu ã shɔraayi viwɔɔ.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yahuza tɛ borodiu rɛ, kɛɗɔn a shɛ ɓilirɛ. Si pɛ a zɨmba.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nya-ãsinɛ sɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Akɨnti gbete Yahuza yaa ɗɔutɛ, Yesɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɔdɔrimkɔ shɔ bassi Shɔzɛja tɛ; shɔ bassi Ɗalapa tɛ au yuukɔ <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Shɔ kɛ bassi Ɗalapa nɛ au yuu, kɛɗɔn Ɗalapa yɛ bassi Shɔzɛja ji au yuu, yɛ pɛlitɔ gbãgbã au yuu. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Maa jaayi, ɗaa yaatɛ pẽtẽrẽ gbete n yɛn ɔ̃ toti a ɔkɔɔni ɓa, ɔ yɛ kangtɔ; ama nagbete n geli yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi nɛ,&lt;Ɗɔgbete n yɛn, yɛyɛ ɔ zɛnɔɔ yɛnɛ ɓa.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />N ãwɔ pɛ nya-ãsinɛ sɔɔ: ɔ ɔri zɔɔ ruubiitɔ. nagbete n gelɔɔ yɛ, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɔ ɔri zɔɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Ɔ kɛ ɔri zɔɔnɛ, kopiya yɛ zɛtɔ nɛwɔ pɛ n jadɔɔyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ sha vigbete yɛ kpauyɛ, Bituru masi nya aɗɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Bituru hɨ Yesɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;A yɛkɛ piya Uɓeyelapa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesɔ kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;A yɛ zɛnnɔɔ gɨnnɛ dɔdɔrim ɓa, ama ɗekɨn sekaa a yɛ gɨntɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />&lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa aru i vi n yɛn zɛnɔɔ a gɨnnɛ ɓa dɔddɔrimni ɓa viya? N kasitɛ n vɔ aa yuu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesɔ kasiunya nɛ,&lt;&lt; A kasitɛ nizɛ a vɔ ang yuu ya? N gelaa tɛ nizɛ: kɔ̃ɔ̃ ɓɛɛ nya ɓaanɛ a yɛ masin nya ɓa taati a nɛn ji zɛn nii ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ kɔ ɔ̃rɛ nyaba yɛnɛ ɓeye ɗɔbii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesɔ geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔkɔɔ yɔri yuunɛ, ɔ ã sisɨn a Ɗalapa bi wɔsɔ̃n ang bi. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Jàá aɗɔn waanɛ a maye wɛrɛni, n yɛn yɛrɛ n tɔ̃rɔɔ ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ tɛlɛ, si ɓa ɗɔkɔ ɓa n si gelɔɔtɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Akɨnti gbete nkɛ tɔ̃rɔɔ ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ nɛ, kɛɗɔn n sɔɔrɛ n tuurɛ ang yuu, aru ɗɔgbete n a ɗɔnmi ɔ ɔ̃ji ɗɔukɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Ɔ zɛ nyaba ɗɔgbete n yɛ tɛttɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Kɛɗɔn Toma geliu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa u ji zɛ ɗɔgbete a yɛ yɛyɛ ɓa; u yɛ zɛ nyaba yɛnɛ ɗɔu kɛpikoviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesɔ kasiunya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ nyaba, a tɔ̃vɨn ãnɛ, nkɔng sɔ̃n suru; shɔwɔɔ ɓa ɗɔnni ɓa gbete yɛ to maye ɗɔbii rɛ setɛ sɔɔtɛ n ɗɔbii. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />A geliyi nɛ, nagbete ɔ zɛnɓankɔ, ɔ yɛ zɛ maye sɔ̃njo, yunɛ dɔdɔrim yɛnɛ ɗekɨn ɔ zɛutɛ, ɔ zɛu sɔ̃ntɛjo awɔ nɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filibu geliu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa, tasiu meye pɛ; Vigbete u kasiyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesɔ kasi Filibu nya nɛ,&lt;&lt;N ɔ̃tɛ a ɔkɔɔni tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ piti kpai; anɛ dɔdɔrim ɔ ji zɛm ɓa ya Filibu? Shɔgbete kɛ zɛnnɛ, si zɛ mayetɛ. Kɛ ruu-ivi a tɔnɛn tasaa maye pɛ viya? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Filibu a ji ã sisɨn ɓaya? Nɛ n a maye yɛti ɓuzɨn, maye sɔ̃nji ang yɛti ɓuzɨn ɓa ya?&gt;&gt; Yesɔ geliu jaɗɔɔyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ruu gbete n gelɔɔ yɛ, ji shɛ ɓa ang ɗɔbii ɓa, maye gbete u ang yɛti ɓuzɨn ukɔ pɛliu vishonɛrɛ ang bi. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Ɔ ã sisɨntɔ ang biini, naa nkɛ gelɔɔ nɛ n-tɛ n a Maye yɛti ɓuzɨn, Maye sɔ̃nji ang yɛti ɓuzɨn. n ɓa ɗɔkɔɓa, ɔ ã sisɨn aru vishɔnɛ gbete n pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Shɔ gbete kɛ ã sisɨn nɛ ang biini yɛ pɛli vishonɛ gbete n pɛliyɛtɔ nn, i yɛ pɛli vigbete tɛɛ shɔmtɔ aru n yɛkɛ maye ɗɔbii. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Vi gbete ɔ kɛ gakinɛ ang nii n yɛn pɛlitɔ aru nɔgbete shɔu tasi maye bassinɛ a Ɓɛɛ jaa bi. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />ko-iviya ɔ kɛ gakinɛ ang nii, n yɛn pɛlitɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rumanɛ Aru Ɗa Suru Anɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Ɔ kɛ ɔrinnɛtɔ, ɔ yɛ gɨnn nya-ãsinɛtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />N yɛn gaki Maye, yɛ ãwɔ shɔ naapɔ̃sinɛtɔ wɔɔtɔ, gbete yɛ ɔ̃ a ɔkɔɔni dangdang. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Ukɔ pɛ Suru shɔ gbete yɛ tasɔɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn ayuu Ɗalapa. Shɔ kootipi yɛ tɛu naa ɓa, aru i yɛ zɛu ɓa nɔni ɓa, ko i zɛurɛ. Ama ɔ zɛutɛ aru u ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ a ɔkɔɔni, u awɔ bikɔ.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Nkɛ yɛnɛ, n yɛn yawɔ ɓa naa javɔni ɓa, n kɛ yɛnɛ, n sɔɔtɔ awɔ ɗɔbiini. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Yaatɛ pẽtẽrẽ kootipi yɛ zɛm tɔɓa, ama ɔ yɛ zɛm ɓɛɛtɔ; aru n a suru ni, ɔkɔɔma ɔ yɛ ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo a suruni.<verse eid="JHN 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Naa leu kaanɛ, ɔ yɛ zɛtɔ nɛ n a mayɛ sisɨn, ɔ sɔ̃nji ang sisɨn, ji naa gbete n awɔ sisɨn yɛ.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />&lt;&lt;Shɔ gbeteyi i kɛ tɛng nya-ãsinɛ nɛ, ai gɨnrɛ i ɔkɔi ɔ̃rɛ shɔ gbeteyi i ɔrintɔ. Maye yɛ ɔri shɔ gbete i ɔrin yɛtɔ, n kɔma n yɛn ɔriyitɔ n tasin yuutɔ ai biini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Kɛɗɔn Yahuza (ɓa Yahuza Isikariyoti ɓa) shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa aru ivi a yɛ tasaa yuu au ɗɔbii, ama ɓa shɔ kootipiyi ɓa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesɔ kasiu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔgbete kɛ ɔrinnɛ gɨn n vimatinɛtɔ, Maye yɛ ɔriitɔ, Maye a nkɔni u yɛu arɛ u ɔ̃ ayini. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Shɔgbete ji ɔrin ɓa, gɨn vigbete n matiyɛ ɓa. N vimatinɛ gbete ɔ ntayɛ ɓa n ma ɓa, ama shɛ a Maye ɗɔbii, gbete shonyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />N gelɔɔ vim kpai sin doo a ɔkɔɔni. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Ama shɔnaapɔ̃sinɛ, Ɗa Suru, gbete Maye yɛ shoyɛ ang nii, yɛ matɔɔ vi kpai, u kpaarɔɔ sisɨn a vigbete n gelɔɔ ɓanni kpai.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Vi gbete n yasɔɔyɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ; n ãwɔ pɛ n ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ, n ji ãwɔ ɓa nagbete kootipi ãyɛ ɓa. Ɔkɔɔ nta yukɔnɛnɛ, ɔkɔɔ nta setinɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Ɔ nta tɛttɔ n gelɔɔ n-tɛ, n yɛn yɛtɔ, ama n yɛn sɔɔ ɔ ɗɔbiitɔ. Ɔ kɛ ɔrinnɛtɔ, ɔ yɛ nta yɛti purutɔ nɛ n yɛn yɛkɛ ɗɔɔ Maye ɗɔbii; aru Maye tɛɛn tɛttɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Dɔdɔrim n gelɔɔ vimtɛ kpai aɗagbete ji gaa pɛ̃nɛ̃ɓa, aru kɛ pɛlinɛ, ɔ yɛ ã sisɨntɔ <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />N yɛn nwanya dɔkɔkɔ tɔɓa a ɔkɔɔni ɓa, aruviya yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa ɗɔkɔkɔni ɓa kpati kotipim akɛtɔ. U kaka ɓa ang yuuni ɓa, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />ama ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ kootipi u zɛtɔ nɛn ɔri Mayetɔ; arumkɔ n pɛli vigbete ãsinnya nɛn pɛliyɛ kpai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">&lt;&lt; Ɔ yunɛ u yaa ɗɔmrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ laa inabi nizɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Nkɔ laa inabi nizɛ, maye ukɔ u shɔ ɓanɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Nalaa gbete ji rɛɛ jaa ɓa ang biini ɓa, yɛ koli kati a ɓili, u tɔ̃ri nalaa gbete rɛɛ jaatɔ tɔ̃vɨn, nɔgbete n ɗau rɛɛ jaa kɛ waanɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Ko dɔdɔrimkɔ shɔ sɔɔ ɔ tɛttɔ gboti wasak aru vi gbete n matɔɔmini. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Ɔ ɓasi yuutɔ a nkɔni, nkɔ ma n yɛ ɓasi yuutɔ a ɔkɔni. Nalaa rɛɛ jaa ɓa au yuuni ɓa; setɛ ɓasinɛ a laani. Yɛ ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo nankɔ ɔ yɛ rɛɛ jaa ɓa setɛ ɔ ɔ̃tɛ a nkɔni.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />&lt;&lt;Nkɔ ɔ̃rɛ laa inabi, a ɔkɔɔ ɔ̃rɛ nalaa. Shɔ gbete i kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ang bi, nkɔ ma n yɛ ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo ai bi. Ɔ yɛ rɛɛ jaa waanɛ; nkɛ ɔ̃ ɓa ɗɔmɓa ɔ yɛ pɛli viwɔɔ dɔɔɓa. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Shɔ gbete i ji ɔ̃ ɓa a nkɔni ɓa u pɛ naa nalaa gbete shɔ lokirɛ au waatiyɛ; nalaa watiwi shɔ tolirɛ a loki a yaa u shaarɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Ɔ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ang yɛti, a n ruubii kɛ ɔ̃nɛ awɔ sisɨn, kɛɗɔn vigbete ɔ kasiyɛ kpai ɔ kɛ gakinɛ, ɔ yɛ kpaatɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Maye bassinɛ yɛ tasitɔ awɔ biini naa ɔkɛ rɛɛ jaanɛ waanɛyɛ; a nyabankɔ ɔ yɛ ɔ̃kɛ n jaɗɔɔyi. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Ji nagbete maye ɔrinyɛ, n kɔma n ɔrɔɔ ji nankɔ. ɔ ɔ̃ ji a ɓusɨng ɔrinɛ gbete n pɛlɔɔnkɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Ɔkɛ gɨn n nya-ãsinɛ nɛ, ɔ yɛ ɔ̃ ang tete ɔriyɛ, ji nagbete n gɨn maye nya-ãsinɛyɛ, a n ɔ̃ au ɓuzɨn ɔrinɛ.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />&lt;&lt;N gelɔɔ vim aru n binyatɔ̃nɛ u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔɔni, a nɔgbete ɔ binyatɔ̃nɛ u ɔ̃ jo piti kpai. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />N nya-ãsinɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ nɛː ɔ ɔrii zɔtɔ, ji nagbete n ɔrɔɔ yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Ɔrinɛ pẽniba gbete ɔ yɛ tasi mɛsayi yɛ, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ ɔ ãwɔ suru ai yuu. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Ɔ pɛ masayi naa ɔkɛ pɛli vigbete n ãsɔɔnyanɛ ayuu. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />N ji ɓawɔɔ toti nɛ fooyi ni ɓa, aru fooyi i ji zɛ vigbete i shɔwɛrɛ pɛliyɛ ɓa. Ama n ɓawɔɔ nɛ masaayi, aruviya n gelɔɔ vigbete n nta a maye nyayɛ tɛttɔ kpai. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Ɓa ɔkɔɔ ɔ lɔnrɛ ɓa, ama nkɔ lɔɔrɛ n tasɔɔ naa abi ɔ yɛrɛ ɔ rɛɛ jaa waanɛ, zɔng nɔlaa gbete yɛ ɔ̃ dangdang yɛ. kɛɗɔn maye yɛ ãwɔ ko iviya tɔ gbete ɔ kɛ gakinɛ ang nii yɛtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Shompɛ nya ãsinɛ gbete n ãsɔɔyɛ; ɔ ɔri zɔtɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koo yɛ bɛ̃ɛ̃ Yesɔ Jadɔɔyi Tɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />&lt;&lt; Naa shɔkɛ bɛ̃ɛ̃ wɔnɛ a koo, ama ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ i gaa bɛ̃ɛ̃nɛ pɛjo nkɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Naa ɔkɛ ɔ̃nɛ shɔ kootipimiyikɔ, shɔ gbeteyi a kotipi i yɛ ɔrɔɔtɔ aru gbete ɔ pɛyi ɓɛɛ. Ama n lɔɔ ɔpɛ a kootipimkɔ, ɔ ɓa shɔ kootipimkɔ ɓa; Arumkɔ shɔ bɛ̃ɛ̃ wɔ ruubi nɔni. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ aru gbete n gelɔɔ yɛ ni: &lt;Fooyi i ji tɛɛ ɓɛshɔwɛrɛyi ɓa a banɛni ɓa.&gt;Naa shɔkɛ tasin ranɛ, shɔyɛ tasɔɔ raa sɔ̃njo; shɔ kɛ gɨnn n vimatinɛ ni, shɔ yɛ gɨnn ɔ ɓɛɛtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Ama i yɛ pɛlɔɔ vimtɔ kpai aru ɔ pɛ mma; aru i ji zɛ shɔgbete shonyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />N si ji a ɓa a nwarinya ayuu ruuvini pɛlinɛni ɓa; i si ji ã yuu ɓa nɛi shɔ ruuvini ɓa, ama dɔdɔrim i nyaba naraanɛ tɔɓa aru ruuvinini ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Shɔgbete kɛ bɛ̃ɛ̃n nɛ, bɛ̃ɛ̃ maye sɔ̃ntɛjo. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />N si ji pɛli vibii-zaanɛ ɓa ai ɗɔbiini gbete shɔwɔyi i ji pɛlinɛ ɓa shããni ɓa, i ruuvini si ɓa; Ama i zɛ vigbete n pɛlitɛ, i bɛ̃ɛ̃ntɛ a mayeni. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Vim ɔ̃ nankɔ aru u yisinya vi gbete shɔ bee ai nya-ãsinɛ nɛu ɔ̃ nizɛ, n ji pɛli vikɔ̃linɛ wɔɔ ɓa piti shɔmni kpai i bẽẽn ruubitɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Shɔ naapɔ̃nɛ yɛ atɔ ukɔ pɛ Suru, gbete yɛ tasɔɔ tɔ̃vɨn aru Ɗalapa yɛ, gbete shɛ a maye ɗɔbii, kɛɗɔn n yɛn shourɛ awɔ ɗɔbii, ukɔ yɛ nwanyarɛ ang yuu. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Ɔkɔɔma ɔ yɛ nwanyatɔ ang yuuni, aru ɔ ɔ̃tɛttɔ a nkɔni au gaanɛ.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />&lt;&lt;N gelɔɔ vimtɛ, aru ɔ sisɨn ãnɛ ukɔu sɔɔ kɨntinɛ <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Shɔyɛ yikɔɔtɔ a Yahudawayi ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛni, ɗaa kaanɛ kopiya kpai kɛ nyowɔnɛ, yɛ tɔnɛ mɛnɛ nɛn pɛli Ɗalapa vishonɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Shɔ yɛ pɛlɔɔ vimtɔ aru i ji zɛ maye ɓa, i ji zɛn ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Ama n gelɔɔ vimtɛ, naa ɗaau kɛ pɛlinɛ gbete i pɛli vim yɛ,kɛɗɔn ɔ yɛ kpaa sisɨn vigbete n gelɔɔtɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗa Suru Vishonɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Ama dɔdɔrim n yɛkɛ shɔgbete shonɛ yɛ ɗɔbii, piti shɔmni kpai awɔ atette shɔwɔ ji hɨm ɓa nɛn yɛkɛ piya ni ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Dɔdɔrim n gelɔɔ vimtɛ ɔ sisɨn lɛsitɔ waanɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Ama n gelɔɔm pɛ nizɛ: n yɛnɛ pɛ tɔ̃vɨn awɔ ɗɔbiini, aru n ji yɛ ɓa, shɔnaapɔ̃sinɛ yɛ awɔ ɗɔbii ɓa, ama n kɛ yɛnɛ, kɛɗɔn n yɛn shourɛ u awɔ ɗɔbiirɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Naa kɛ anɛ yɛ tasi shɔ koopitiyi tɔnɛ i ji pɛliɓa vitɔ̃vɨng ɓa ayuu ruuvini, ayuu vitɔ̃vɨng wɔsɔ̃n ayuu Ɗalapa ruuyeenɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Aru gbete i ji ã sisɨn ɓa ang biini ɓa i niitɛ ayuu ruuvini i pɛliyɛni, <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />nɛi sisɨn niitɛ ayuu vitɔ̃vɨng ni, aru n yɛkɛ Maye ɗɔbii ɔ yɛ zɛn toɓa dangdang; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Nɛi sisɨn niitɛ ayuu ruuyeenɛni, aru kpati kootipimi shɔ yeeruutɛ gboti au yuuni.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />&lt;&lt;N ruugbete n kasɔɔ gelinɛ aɗɔn waanɛ, ama ɔ yɛ zɛnɔɔ sãnɛ ɓa dɔddɔrimni kpai niɓa. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Ama naa Ɗa Suru shɔ gbete yɛ hãsi ruu tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa yuu kaanɛ, yɛ matɔɔ vitɔ̃vɨngtɔ kpai. Yɛ nwanya ɓa au kaka ɓa, ama yɛ nwanya a vigbete au ntayɛ u gelɔɔ vigbete kaanɛ ɗekɨn yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Yɛ basinɛtɔ, aruviya yɛ tu vigbete n shayɛ u gelɔɔrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Vigbete Maye a wuniyɛ pɛ n maa; aruukɔ n gelɔɔ n-tɛ, Ɗa suru yɛ tu vigbete n ãuyɛ u gelɔɔrɛ.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sisɨn Hɨmri A Sisɨn Puru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />&lt;&lt;Ɗaa kaanɛ gbete ɔ zɛn toɓa, a kɨntiuni sekaa ɔ zɛn sɔ̃nrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ jaɗɔɔyi gãsi i hɨ zɔɔ ai nɔɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Rum u dɔɔ kɛnɛ-iviya? Geliunɛ, ɗaa kaanɛ gbete u yɛ zɛn tɔɓa, a kɨntiuni sekaa ɔ zɛn sɔ̃nrɛ; a sha sɔ̃nɛ,&lt;Aru gbete n yɛ Maye ɗɔbii.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />U dɔɔ ruu gbete shanɛ a kɨntiuni sekaa kɛnɛ-iviya? U ji zɛ ruugbete nwanya au yuu ɓɛjo ɓaǃ &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesɔ zɛ tɛttɔ i kasiu ruu hɨnɛ, kɛɗɔn a geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt;N sha n-tɛ, &lt;A kɨntiuni sekaa ɔ yɛ zɛn tɔɓa, a kɨntiuni sekaa ɔ yɛ zɛn sɔ̃ntɔ.&gt;Nn vigbete ɔ hɨli zɔ awɔ nɔɔyɛ ya? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />N gelɔɔm pɛ vi nizɛ: Ɔ sɨnrɛ ɔ lɛrirɛ, ama shɔgbeteyi a kootipi i yɛ nta ɓɛjo sisɨn puru; ɔ sisɨn lɛsirɛ, ama ɔ sisɨn lɛsinɛ yɛ ɔ̃kɛ sisɨn puru. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Naa soro kaanɛ a ɗɔ jaa yeenɛ, u sisɨn lɛsitɔ aru u ɗaa raaɓoonɛ atɛ; Ama naa kɛ yejaanɛ, sukiu raaɓoonɛu kɛtɔ, aru nta sisɨn puru jaa shɛ ɓilitɛ a koo. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Vim nankɔ ɔkɔɔniː dɔdɔrim ɔ tete sisɨn hɨmri, ama n yɛ zɛwɔɔ sɔ̃ntɔ, ɔ yɛti yɛ yii a sisɨn puru, a sisɨn puru gbete shɔwɔ yɛ zɛnɔɔ ranɛ ɓa awɔ naani ɓa.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />&lt;&lt; Naa leu atɛ ɔ yɛ hɨ ruu wɔɔ ɓa. Gelɔɔm pɛ vi nizɛ: Maye yɛ ãwɔ ko iviya gbete gaki ang niitɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Anɛ dɔdɔrim ɔ ji gaki vi wɔɔ ɓa ang nii ɓa; ɔkɛ gakinɛ Ɗalapa yɛ ãwɔtɔ, nɔgbete ɔ sisɨn puru u ɔ̃ piti kpai.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗa shaarintɛ ayuu koo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />&lt;&lt;N pɛli vishonɛ a ruɓusinɛ n gelɔɔ vimrɛ. Ama ɗaa kaanɛ gbete n yɛn pɛli vishonɛ ɓa a ruɓusinɛ toti ɓa, ama n yɛn nwanya n hãsibaras a Maye ruubii. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Naa leeu kaanɛ, ɔ yɛ gakiutɔ ang nii; ɔkɔɔ shanɛ, nɛ nkɔng yɛ gakiu rɛ awɔ yuuni, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />arumkɔ Maye au yuu ɔrɔɔtɔ. Ɔrɔɔ aru gbete ɔ ɔrinyɛ, aru ɔ ã sisɨntɛ nɛ n apɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />N shɛ a Maye ɗɔbii a n a kotipi rɛ; zɛ tɛttɔ n yɛn yaa kootipi kɛtɔ n yɛkɛ Maye ɗɔbii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ jaɗɔɔyi i geliu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɔdɔrim a sha ruukɛ baras, a ji pɛli shonɛ ɓa a ruɓusinɛ niɓa. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />U zɛ tɛttɔ dɔdɔrim a zɛ vi tɛttɔ kpai; a ji kã ruu hɨlinɛ tɔɓa.Vim pɔ̃tɛ u ã sisɨn tɛ nɛ a shɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesɔ risiu jaɗɔɔyi nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɔdɔrim ɔ ã sisɨn kɛtɛ ya? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />ɗaa kaanɛ, atɛtɔ gboti, ɔ piti kpai ɔ yɛ sãtikɛtɔ, kopiya yɛ yɛjo u wɛrɛ, shɔyɛ yan a yɔhm. Ama a suru n ɓa n yɔhm ɓa, aru iviya Maye u a nkɔni. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />N gelɔɔ vim aru ɔ kpaa ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ ang bi, Shɔ kootipi i yɛ pɔ̃ ɔrɛ ɔ ɓooraarɛ. Ama ɔ mabiitɔ Ɗa shaarin tɛttɔ gboti a kootipi yuuni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ gaki u jaɗɔɔyi Ɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Akɨnti gbete Yesɔ yisinya vim shanɛtɛ, a ɗenɔɔ a kolapa a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Maye, ɗaa pɛlitɛ ã mɛjaau bassinɛ nɛ, nɔgbete mɛjaau yɛ ãa basinɛ sɔ̃njoyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Aru a ãu kaka tɛttɔ a shɔzɛ yuu kpai a koo, nɛu ã shɔgbete a ãuyɛ suru gbete sɔ̃nya ɓa piti kpai. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Suru gbete yisi ɓa ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔu zɛattɔ, makaa Ɗalapa nizɛ gbete sheeli, a shɔu zɛ Yesɔ kirisi gbete a shouyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />N tasaa shɔ a bassinɛ tɛttɔ a kootipini; N yisinya vishonɛ gbete a ãng nɛn pɛliyɛ tɛttɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Mayeǃ Ãng bassinɛ pɛ aa ɗekɨn dɔdɔrim, bassinɛ gbete n a wuniyɛ aa ɗekɨn gbete si a ji pɛli koo pɛ̃nɛ̃ba.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />&lt;&lt;N pɔ̃tɛ shɔgbete a ãng yɛ a koo i zɛa niitɛ. i pɛ a ɓɛɛkɔ, ama a ãng itɛ, i gɨn a nya-ãsinɛtɛ, <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />ama dɔdɔrim i zɛ tɛttɔ ko-iviya gbete a ãng yɛ shɛjo aa ɗɔbii kɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Ruu gbete a ãng yɛ nɛn geliyitɔ, n geliyitɛ i tɛ tɛ̀; i zɛ dɔdɔrim tɛ nizɛ nɛ n shɛpɛ aa ɗɔbii, i ã-sisɨn tɛttɔ nɛ pɛ mokɔ shonrɛ.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />&lt;&lt;N gaki Ɗa ai yuu, n ji gaki Ɗa ɓa aru shɔ kootipiyi i yuu ɓa ama aru shɔgbete a ãng yɛ, aru gbete i pɛ a ɓɛɛ yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Vigbete n a wuniyɛ kpai pɛ a ɓɛɛ, a vigbete a wuniyɛ kpai pɛ n ɓɛɛ; aru n bassinɛ yɛ tasijo ai kabiikɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Dɔdɔrim n kaanɛ a ɗɔbi; n toti a kootipini ɓa, ama i ɓɛɛ a kootipi. Maye wɔsɔ-wɔsɔǃ kɔitɔ a kaka gbete aa nii yɛ, nii gbete a ãng yɛ, a nɔgbete i yɛ ɔ̃ gbete naa nkɔ a mokɔni yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Aɗagbete n si a yini yɛ, n kɔitɔ a kaka gbete shɛ aa nii yɛ, nii gbete a ãng yɛ, n kɔitɔ ko shɔzɛ gbete ai tete ji nii ɓa see shɔgbete shɔ yeeurɛ jaa lɛsinɛkɔ nwaani aru u yisinya vigbete janyagadi I shayɛ u ɔ̃ nizɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Dɔdɔrim n kaanɛ aa ɗɔbii, n sha vim a koo nɔgbete i yɛ nta yɛti puru a nkɔni a vigbete i pɛliyɛ ni kpai. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />N geliyi a nyaruubii tɛ, shɔ kootipiyi i bɛ̃ɛ̃yi ruubii tɔ, aru gbete i ɓa shɔ kotipiyi ɓa, ji naa nɔgbete n ɓa shɔ kootipi ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />N ji gakaa ɓanɛ a tuuyitɔ a kotipi ni ɓa, ama n gaki rɛ a kɔyitɔ aru shɔnɔpɔ̃ i yɛ lɛsiyirɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Ji nɔgbete n ɓa shɔ kootipi ɓa, ikɔma i ɓa shɔ kootipi ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Tɔ̃riyitɔ i ɔ̃ a ɓɛɛ aru gbete a ruu pɛ nizɛ; <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />N shoyi a koo, ji nɔgbete a shon a koo yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Jo ai yuukɔ n ãng yuurɛ, nɔgbete ikɔma i yɛ ã yuu sɔ̃njo aa ɗɔbiini.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />&lt;&lt;N ji gaki ɓa ai yuukɔ sheeli ɓa, ama sɔ̃njo a shɔgbete i ãsisɨn ang biiyɛ aru gbete i shayɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />N gaki rɛ i piti kpai i ɔ̃ gbete. Mayeǃ Mɛnɛ i ɔ̃ au sisɨn naa gbete u a mokɔniyɛ, ji nagbete a ang yɛti, n kɔma n sɔ̃njo aa yɛti. I ɔ̃jo nankɔ nɔgbete shɔ kootipi iyɛ ã sisɨn nɛ, mɔkɔ shonrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />N ãi jo bassinɛ gbete a ãyɛ kɔ, nɔgbete i yɛ ɔ̃ gbete, naa nkɔ a mokɔni u gbete yɛː <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />N ai sisɨn, mokɔma a sɔ̃njo ang sisɨn, nɔgbete i yɛ ɔ̃ gbete piti kpai, aru gbete shɔ kootipi i yɛ zɛnɛ mɔkɔ shonrɛ nɛn ɔriyitɔ nagbete a ɔrinyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />&lt;&lt;Mayeǃ A ãng i tɛttɔ a naa, ama n kasirɛ i ɔ̃ a ɗɔgbete n a ɗɔnniyɛ, nɔgbete i zɛn basinɛ yɛ, basinɛ gbete a ãyɛ; Aru a tasin ɔrinɛ tɛttɔ si a ji pɛli koo pɛ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Mayeǃ Shɔ tɔ̃vɨn, shɔ kootipi i ji zɛa nii ɓa, ama n zɛa ɓɛɛtɛ, aru a jaɗɔɔyi i zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ pɛ mɔkɔ shongrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />N pɔ̃yirɛ i zɛa niitɛ, n yɛn yɛ ɗekɨn a pɛlinɛni nankɔ, aru ɔrinɛ gbete a tasin yɛ u ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo ai sisɨnni, a nɔgbete n yɛn ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo ai sisɨnni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ sãnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Akɨnti gbete naa Yesɔ gaki Ɗa tɛ nam, kɛɗɔn Yesɔ au jaɗɔyini i yaa ɗɔu i yɛkɛ ɗɔɔ wɔ gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ Kidoro Boroki. Si jaa wɔɔ ɗɔuni, Yesɔ au jaɗɔɔyini i to ɓuzɨn jaaurɛ i ɔ̃ ɗɔuni. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yahuza gbete mɛli Yesɔ yɛ ukɔma zɛ ɗɔu tɛttɔ, aru kopiɗaviya Yesɔ au jaɗɔɔyini i kpɛsi zɔɔ a ɗɔukɔ. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Kɛɗɔn Yahuza yɛ dɔjau, tuu kɨǹ soja Romayi a gãsi shɔ wɛrɛ Ɗa ganɛyini, yupɛ̃ni shɔlansiyi a Farasiyayi shorɛ; i sãli layaa a pitila wɔsɔ̃n toshiyi a naa. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesɔ shɔu, zɛ vigbete yɛ kpauyɛ tɛttɔ, kɛɗɔn shɛ a ɗekɨn a hɨyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ kã pi ɗɔ piya? &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Shɔwiyi kasi Yesɔ nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Yesɔ shɔ nazara.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yesɔ shanɛ,&lt;&lt; n pɛ ukɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yahuza gbete mɛli Yesɔ yɛ u si jo a ɗɔɔ shinɛ a ɗɔukɔ. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Naa Yesɔ geliyitɛ, &lt;&lt;pɛ nkɔ,&gt;&gt; kɛɗɔn i sɔɔ akɨnti ai wẽsirɛ tipi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Toti Yɛsɔ hɨyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ kã pi ɗɔ piya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">I shanɛ,&lt;&lt; Yɛsɔ shɔ Nazara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yɛsɔ kasinyanɛ,&lt;&lt;N gelɔɔ tɛttɔ n-tɛ n pɛ ukɔ. Naa ɔkɛ kãnɛ nkɔ, ɔ yaa shɔmi yinɛ i yɛrɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Yesɔ sha vim nankɔ aru vigbete shayɛ u ɔ̃ nizɛː &lt;&lt; Maye, atette shɔ gbeteyi a ãng yɛ n jo lɔkiyi ɓa gbete ni ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Siman Bituru, u si zaali naa zɔ̃rɛ a ko yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa u foo yusho shɔ nakɨn. Foou nii nɛ Makus. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yesɔ geli Bituru nɛ, &lt;&lt;Sɔraa zaali nɛ au ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛǃ A ji zɛ ɓa nɛ ɔrintɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ n ɓoraatɔ a kɔpi gbete maye ãyɛ ɓa ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ a Anasi ɗekɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Kɛɗɔn soja Roma ai yupɛ̃niyi ni wɔsɔ̃n yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi i sã Yesɔ rɛ, <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />i gau n tinɛ pɛ Anasi ɗekɨn. Ukɔ pɛ Kayafa ɓɛso ɓeye, Kayafa ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa a saa uni. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Si ji kayafa kɔ geli yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi nɛ, kɔritɔ shɔzɛ gbete u vɔrɛ aru u raa shɔzɛ gãsi kpai.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bituru masi Yesɔ nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Siman Bituru a Yesɔ jaɗɔɔ wɔ i gɨn Yesɔrɛ. Si yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa zɛ Yesɔ jaɗɔɔu tɛttɔ, kɛɗɔn Bituru a Yesɔ jaɗɔɔuni i gɨn Yesɔ yɛnɛ yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi a wɛrɛ Ɗa yɛti wɛrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Ama Bituru shi a nyaba wɛrɛ a kaɓili. Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ jaɗɔɔ wɔɔu shɛrɛ a nwanya a nyaba wɛrɛ a jasu wɔɔni i tosi Bituru ɓuzɨnrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Jasuu gbete a nyaba wɛrɛ hɨ Bituru nɛ, &lt;&lt;Naa a ji ɓuzɨn jaam u jadɔɔyi kɔ viya?&gt;&gt; Bituru kasi nyanɛ&lt;&lt;Ɓa, ɓang nkɔ ɓa,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Si a ɗaa sɔrɔɔ, kɛɗɔn jawɛrɛyi a shɔ ɗɔganɛyi i wu yaa i ɗɔgbete i shili ɗɔuniyɛ, i ɗɔɔ sɔrɔɔ bàànɛ. A Bituru yɛ sɔ̃njo shi ayini a nyazɔ aɗɔ sɔrɔɔ bàànɛ ni.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yupɛ̃ni Shɔlansi a wɛrɛ Ɗa hɨli Yesɔ ruu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Yupɛ̃ni Shɔlansi a wɛrɛ Ɗa hɨli Yesɔ ruu ayuu u jaɗɔɔyi wɔsɔ̃n u vimatinɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesɔ kasinyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ko-pi lee piya n nwanya a shɔ shoo piti kpai; n vimatinɛ piti n pɛli a Yahudawayi ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ wɔsɔ̃n a wɛrɛ Ɗa, a ɗɔgbete kopiya kpai i toli a ɗɔzɔɔ, n ji mati shɔvi jo a ɗɔ ɓusinɛni shãã ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Ɔ hɨlin ruukɛ aru iviya? Ɔ hɨli ruujo shɔ gbete i wesho ang vi gbete n shayɛ. Ɔ hɨyi ruu gbete ang geliyɛ pɛ, i zɛ vigbete ang sha tɛttɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Naa Yesɔ sha vimtɛ, shɔzɛ gbete atette shɔ ɗɔganɛ wa Yesɔ naa a nya a shanɛ,&lt;&lt; A kasi yupɛ̃ni nya nan ka!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesɔ kasiunya nɛ, &lt;&lt;N kɛ sha vikɔ̃linɛ wɔnɛ, geli shɔvi gbete ang shayɛnɛ aɗɔm kpai. Ama vi n shayɛ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn a wankɛ ruu iviya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Kɛɗɔn Anasi sɔriu Kayafa yupɛ̃ni a wɛrɛ Ɗa ɗɔbiirɛ.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bituru Masi Yesɔ Nya Toti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Si Bituru u doo ɗɔɔ yaa wɔɔnɛ. Kɛɗɔn shɔwɔyi i geliunɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɓa mokaa jaam jadɔɔ gbete wɔɔ ɓaya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Ama Bituru masinyaɗɔn. A shanɛ,&lt;&lt;N ɓa ɓuzɨn ni ɓa,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Shɔzɛ gbete atette yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi a wɛrɛ Ɗa u foo, pɛ shɔgbete Bituru kɔu yusho u shɔbii, ukɔ nwanya, a hɨnɛ,&lt;&lt;N ji ɓa mɔkɔ awuni a jaa ɓaya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Bituru kasinya sɔ̃nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɓa&gt;&gt;Tɛ̃ɛ̃ti kpasi kɔ̃ ɓanyarɛ.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ A Bilatu Ɗekɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />A gadi zɨɨnkɔ shɔ shɛshi Yesɔ rɛ a Kayafa wɛrɛ yɛnɛ gɔmna jaa ruunwanɛ. Ama yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi i ji to ɓuzɨn jaa ruunwanɛu ɓa, aru nɛi yɛ ɔ̃rɛ ɓa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ɓa a Ɗa ɗekɨn, i kpaa nyaba vishaanɛ yumusinɛ tɛnɛda shaanɛ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Kɛɗɔn Bilatu shɛ ɓili ai ɗɔbii a hɨyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ wili jaam pi ru-iviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />I kasiuyanɛ, &lt;&lt;U si ɓa shɔ ruuvini ɓa u si ji n-tiu ɓa aa ɗekɨn niɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Kɛɗɔn Bilatu geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt; Ɔ yɛnɛ ɔ yuu ɔ hɨliu ruurɛ nɔgbete ɔ nya-ãsinɛ shayɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">I kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ ji yasiu nyaba ɓa nɛu nyo shɔwɔ vɔrɔ ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Vim pɛli nankɔ aru u yisinya vigbete Yesɔ shayɛ ama sha vim u tasi nɔgbete yɛ vɔyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Bilatu sɔɔ yɛti wɛrɛ a ɓa Yesɔ nya a hɨunɛ, &lt;&lt;Mokɔ ɔ̃rɛ kpati Yahudawa ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesɔ kasinyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Mɔkɔ sha vim ji ya? ko shɔ wɔɔyi i gelaarɛ ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Bilatu kasinyanɛ, &lt;&lt;A tuu a sisɨn nɛn shɔ Yahudawa ya? Pɛjo a shɔbiiyikɔ a yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi a wɛrɛ Ɗa ikɔi n taarɛ ang ɗɔbiini. A pɛliyi iviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesɔ geli Bilatu nɛ, &lt;&lt; N kpati roonɛ ɓa shɔ kootipimkɔ ɓa; n kpati roonɛ si tɔnɛn ɔ̃ shɔ kootipimkɔ, n jadɔɔyi si yɛ waabatɔ nɛ shɔu n ting ɓa a yupɛ̃ni Yahudawa ɗekɨn ni ɓa. N kpati roonɛ ɓa shɔ kootipimkɔ ɓa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Kɛɗɔn Bilatu hɨunɛ, &lt;&lt;Akɛ kpati ya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesɔ kasinyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Mɔkɔ sharɛ nɛn kpati. Shɔ yeenrɛ n a kootipim ji a rumkɔ, aru nɛn nwanya ayuu vi tɔ̃vɨn. Shɔgbete kɛ ã tɔ̃vɨn nɛ weshotɔ ang nyani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Bilatu hɨunɛ &lt;&lt;Shɔ ɓaa tɔ̃vɨn ɓɛɛ iviya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 18:38">Shɔ Yeeruu Nɛ Yesɔ Yɛ Vɔtɔ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Kɛɗɔn Bilatu sɔɔ shɔwiyi ɗɔbii a ɓili gelinɛ, &lt;&lt;N ji kpaa jam ɓa a ruukɔ̃linɛ wɔɔni ɓa, gbete yɛtɛ nɔgbete shɔ nyou vɔrɔ yɛ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Ama ji nagbete ɔ nakoo sãyɛ, n yasɔɔ shɔzɛ gbete naa a ɗaa yumusinɛ tɛnɛɗa, ɔ kasinɛn yasɔɔ kpati Yahudawam naa ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />I kasinya a gãgãni, i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɓa ukɔ ɓaǃ U kasi a yasiu Barnaba naaǃ&gt;&gt; (Barnaba u si shɔnyaba zɛ̃nɛ.)<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Kɛɗɔn Bilatu pɔ̃rɛ nɛ sojayi waa Yesɔ a kpaataa. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Sojayi i tɔ̃ri wayuu kɔkɔ i hãsi Yesɔ rɛ yuu; Kɛɗɔn i tosiu fãrã nweri gbete naa kpatiyi i hã yɛ a bi, <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />i arɛ au ɗɔbii i geliunɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ̃ a suruni kpati Yahudawaǃ &gt;&gt;Sojayi i yurɛ i waau naa a kashinya.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Bilatu shɛ bili sɔ̃nrɛ a geli mooyi nɛ, &lt;&lt; Ɔ kɨnnɔɔ pɛ n yɛn shɛshi Yesɔ aɗɔm dɔdɔrim, aru ɔ zɛ jo awɔ nɔɔ n ji kpauu ɓa aru kɔ̃linɛ wɔɔni gbete yɛtɛ nɔgbete shɔ nyouni ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ shɛ ɓilirɛ, tosi wayuu kɔkɔ a fãrã ni abi naa kpatiyi ɓɛɛ. Bilatu geli moowi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ kɨnnɔɔ pɛǃ Jaau u yɛmǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Naa yupɛ̃ni shɔlansiyi wɛrɛ Ɗa a shɔ ɗɔganɛyi wɛrɛ Ɗa i zɛ Yesɔ tɛ, i shaati nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ ɓau naa nɛ laaǃ Shɔ ɓau naa nɛ laaǃ&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Bilatu geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ tuu nɛ ɔ ɓau naa laa awɔ yuu. N ji kpau ɓa aru wɔɔni gbete yɛtɛ nɔgbete shɔ nyouni ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Moowi i kasi Bilatu nya nɛ, &lt;&lt;U nya-ãsinɛ ɗɔn gbete shanɛ yɛtɛ anɔgbete shɔ nyou vɔrɔni, aru gbete shanɛ, nɛn pɛ Ɗalapa jaa yɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Naa Bilatu nta vigbete moowi geliu yɛtɛ, seti pɛliu waanɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />kɛɗɔn Bilatu sɔɔu yɛti wɛrɛ a hɨ Yesɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;A shɛ pi ɗɔpiya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Ama Yesɔ ji risi Bilatu nya ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Bilatu geli Yesɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt; A yɛ nwarin nya ɓaya? N kaka aɗɔn n yaa a naarɛ weze a yarɛ, wɔsɔ̃n n kaka aɗɔn n pɔ̃rɛ shɔ ɓaa a naa laa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesɔ kasi Bilatu nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;A kaka gbete ang yuu pɛ shɔ gbete Ɗalapa ayɛkɔ sheeli. Ama jaa gbete au ãng a, a naa tɛa tɛttɔ a ruuvini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Naa Bilatu nta vimtɛ, a kã nyaba nɛn yaa Yesɔ naa, ama moowi shaati nya sɔ̃n i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Akɛ yau naa nɛ, si a ɓa Kayisa ɓɛsa ɓaǃ Shɔu kɛ tonɛ kpati, si tasiu yuutɛ zali a Kayisaniǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Naa Bilatu nta ruumtɛ, a shɛshi Yesɔ ɓilirɛ kɛɗɔn yurɛ a ɔ̃ a la ɔ̃nɛ ruuvɔsinɛ a ɗɔgbete shɔ ɓaanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗɔ tari pɔ̃linɛ&gt;&gt;(A nya Hibiru shɔ ɓaanɛ &lt;&lt;Gabbata.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Lee yumusinɛ tɛnɛda ɓɛɛ anɛ, si tete niti ɓatɛ maani. Bilatu geli mɔɔwi nɛ, &lt;&lt;N kɔɔ kpati yɛmǃ &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Moowi shaati nya sɔ̃n nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔu nyounɛǃ Shɔu nyounɛǃ Shɔ ɓau naa nɛ laaǃ&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Bilatu hɨ moowi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ kasi nɛn ɓaa ɔ kpati naa a laa ya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Yupɛ̃ni shɔlansiyi wɛrɛ Ɗa i kasiunya nɛ, &lt;&lt;U kpati ɓɛɛ jo gbete Kasisa sheeliǃ &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Kɛɗɔn Bilatu ã Yesɔ rɛ nɛ sojayi i ɓau naa nɛ a laa.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">Shɔ Ɓaa Yesɔ Nalaa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ i yɛ awuni. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesɔ tuu laa gbete shɔ ɓau naa aɗɔn a shɛ ɓilirɛ, a arɛ a,&lt;&lt;Ɗɔzɔ̃pu.&gt;&gt;(A nya Hibiru shɔ ɓaanɛ, Goligota.) <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />I ɓaa Yesɔ nalaa aɗɔwakɔ; a i ɓaa jaa wɔɔyi i ziti naa sɔ̃njo awuni, gbete a nakɨn gbete a nagã a Yesɔ ai tete. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Bilatu bee ruu a pɔ̃ laa gbete shɔ ɓaunɛ naa aɗɔnyɛ. nɛ,&lt;&lt;Yesɔ shɔ Nazara, Kpati Yahudawayi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Shɔzɛ waanɛ i ɓali vigbete shɔ bee yɛtɔ, aruviya ɗɔgbete shɔ ɓaa Yesɔ nalaa aɗɔn ɓa kpɛlɛ a komooni ɓa. Shɔ bee vim a nya Hibiru, wɔsɔ̃n Latin a nya Giriki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa geli Bilatu nɛ, &lt;&lt; Mokɔ bee nɛ, kpati Yahudawa,&gt;&gt; Ama a bee nɛ, jaam shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Nkɔ kpati Yahudawa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Bilatu kasiunya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Vigbete n beetɛm, n ɓeetɛ gboti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Akɨnti gbete sojayi ɓaa Yesɔ naatɛ, i tuu fãrã i vɔsirɛ kǹ nɛ̃ɛ̃ti, kopiya tuu kǹ gbete. I tuu u kpẽnti fãrã gbete a shɔ ji hã ɓa, ama fãrã shɔ ntaa kagbete yunɛ paa yɛnɛu dii. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Kɛɗɔn sojayi geli zɔ̃nɛ, &lt;&lt;U ntaa ɓa, ama u nta laapaa pɛ au yuu, u zɛ shɔgbete yɛ shaayɛkɨn. Vim pɛli nankɔ aru u yisinya vigbete Ɗa nyaruubii shayɛ ɔ̃ nizɛː</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">&lt;&lt;I vɔsin fãrã bi ai nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">I ntaa laapaa ang yuu fãrã.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Shompɛ vigbete sojayi pɛliyɛkɔ.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Shɔgbete i shi maani a ɗɔɔ laa gbete shɔ ɓaa Yesɔ naa ɗɔnyɛ, si Yesɔ ɓini, a bɛzɔ̃ Mariyamu Kayafa ɓeso a Mariyamu su Magadala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesɔ zɛ ɓini au jaɗɔɔ gbete ɔriyɛ a ɗɔɔ shinɛ a ɗɔu; Kɛɗɔn a geli ɓini nɛ, &lt;&lt;Mani mɛjau yɛm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliu jaɗɔɔu nɛ, &lt;&lt; U pɛ Miniu.&gt;&gt;Yunɛ a ɗaukɔ Yesɔ jaɗɔɔu tuu Yesɔ ɓinirɛ yɛnɛ u wɛrɛ.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Vɔnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Yesɔ zɛrɛ nɛ dɔdɔrim ko iviya yisi nyatɛttɔ; aru u yisinya vigbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ u ɔ̃ nizɛ, kɛɗɔn Yesɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;N nta sutumii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Jabũsi mii inabi gbari wɔɔ siɗɔn, i lu soosorɛ ɗɔn i maa a laa i ã Yesɔrɛ a nya. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Naa Yesɔ ɓoo mii gbariutɛ a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Yisitɛǃ&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ ɓaki yuurɛ dii a ãu sururɛ.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Ɓa Yesɔ A Kagɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Kɛɗɔn yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi i gaki Bilatu rɛ nɛu ãi naa aru i kaki ɓɔɔ zitiwi dɔɔ, gbete shɔ ɓayi nalaa yɛ, nɛ shɔu nɔsiyi bi ayuu laa gbete shɔ ɓayi naa ɗɔnniyɛ. I gaki vim aru leeu si lee susunɛ, i ji kasiɓa nɛ lee susunɛ u kpaarɛ i bi doo a laa gbete shɔ ɓayi naa a ɗɔnni yɛ ɓa, aru lee susunɛ gbete yɛ a yɛ pɛ lee pɛ̃niɓa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Kɛɗɔn sojayi i a ɗɔɔ shɔ gbete shɔ ɓai nalaa a Yesɔni ɗɔzɔɔ, i kaki shɔ ɗekɨn dɔɔ rɛ, kɛɗɔn i yɛrɛ i kaki shɔu pɛsiyɛ dɔɔ sɔ̃nrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Naa i atɛ Yesɔ ɗɔbii, i zɛrɛ vɔtɛ gboti, ama i ji kakiu dɔɔ toti ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Shɔzɛ gbete atette sojayi, ɓaa Yesɔ a shala a kagɨn, tɛ̃ɛ̃ti kpaa a mii ni shɛrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />(Shɔgbete au zɛ vim pɛliyɛ au nɔɔ ukɔ sharɛ, nɔgbete ɔkɔma ɔ ã sisɨnrɛ ɗɔn. Vigbete shayɛ pɛ nizɛ, zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ vigbete shayɛ nɛ pɛ nizɛ.) <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Vim pɛli nankɔ aru u yisinya vigbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ u ɔ̃ nizɛː &lt;&lt;Shɔ yɛ kau kaka wɔɔ ɓa ko gbete.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Ɗanyaruubii wɔsɔ̃n ɗɔn gbete shanɛ, &lt;&lt;I yɛ kɨnnɔɔ a shɔgbete i ɓauyɛ bi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ gbãnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Akɨnti vim, Yusufu gbete a tipi Arimatiya u si jo Yesɔ jadɔɔ kɔ, gaki Bilatu nɛu ãng naa nɛn tuu Yesɔ bi pɛ. (Ama a kaɓusinɛ, aru nta seti yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi.) Bilatu geli Yusufu nɛ, a yɛ zɛnɔɔ Yesɔ bi tuunɛtɔ, kɛɗɔ Yusufu arɛ a tuurɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodimu, shɔgbete gaa Yesɔ ɗɔbii yɛnɛ ama a zɨmɓa, yɛ a Yusufuni, tuu nɔɔ sũrũ-sũrũ shɔ ɓaanɛ mur shɔ wee a alos gbete u kpetinɛ siyɛ ɔ̃ bmati atu kopi. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ zitimiyi i tuu Yesɔ vɔrɔ i lirɛ a fãrã vɔrɔ gbãnɛ shɔ ɓaanɛ lili, a nɔɔ sũrũ-sũrũ ni, nagbete Yahudawayi nakoo sãyɛ a ɗaa vɔrɔ gbãnɛ yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />A ɗɔgbete shɔ nyo Yesɔ yɛ jaa wɔɔ si ɗɔn, a ɓuzɨn jaaukɔ yusàà si ɗɔn gbete shɔ ji gbã vɔrɔ ɓa ɗɔn shããni ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Si yɛ ɔ̃kɛ leeukɔ lee susunɛ ɓɛɛ pɛlinɛ, aru yusààu si maani, kɛɗɔn i tuu Yesɔ birɛ i gbãrɛ ɗɔn.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Yunɛ Sàà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />A gadii zɨɨnkɔ si ɗɔ doo zɨnzɨna a lee gbete gaa yɛ, Mariyamu su Magadala yɛ yusàà a zɛrɛ shɔ dɔ̃ tari tɛ a nya sààuni. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Kɛɗɔn su yudɛinɛ yɛnɛ Siman Bituru a Yesɔ jaɗɔɔ gbete ɔriuyɛ ɗɔbii a geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ tuu Uɓeyelapa tɛttɔ sààni, u ji zɛ ɗɔgbete shɔ pɔ̃u a ɗɔnni ɓaǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Kɛɗɔn Bituru a Yesɔ jaɗɔɔ wɔɔ i yɛ yusààurɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />I ziti piti i si ɗɔ yuunɛ, ama Yesɔ jaɗɔɔ wɔɔ yuurɛ a tɛɛ Bituru rɛ, ukɔ gaa yusààu tonɛrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />A ɓakirɛ a zɛ fãrã vɔrɔ gbãnɛkɔ sheeli, ama ji to ɓuzɨn sàà wu ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Au knti si kɛ Siman Bituru, u ɓɛɛ anɛ see tonɛ sàà. A zɛ fãrã vɔrɔ gbãnɛ shɔ yɔtɛ a ɗɔuni. <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />A zɛ fãrã gbete si shɔ masi Yesɔ aɗɔ yuu yɛ shɔ yɔtɛ ka gbete, ɓa fãrã vɔrɔ gbãnɛni a nyazɔ ɓa, ama fãrãu shɔ litɛ shɔ pɔ̃utɛ kagbete. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ jaɗɔɔ gbete gaa yusààu tonɛ, ukɔma to ɓuzɨn rɛ; a zɛrɛ a ã sisɨnrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />A shɔmni kpai i ji zɛ vigbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ nɛ, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ Yesɔ u yulapa tɔ a suruni a sàà ni. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ jaɗɔɔu sɔɔ wɛrɛ rɛ.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Shɛ a Mariyamu su Magadala Bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Mariyamu shirɛ a nya sàà a ɓili u ɗɔɔ sɨnɛ, a ɗagbete siu doo ɗɔɔ sɨnɛ, sɔ̃sirɛ a kɨnnɔɔ ɓuzɨn sààuni <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />A zɛ Ɗajashonɛlapayi ziti a fãrã puruni a bi, i ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔgbete shɔ pɔ̃ Yesɔ bi ɗɔnyɛ, gbete shi au yuu wɔɔ shi au ɗɔ dɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Ɗajashonɛlapa i hɨ suu nɛ,&lt;&lt; Sum a sɨn aru iviya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Suu kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ tuun Uɓeyelapatɛ, n ji zɛ ɗɔgbete shɔ pɔ̃u yɛ ɓaǃ &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Kɛɗɔn suu kɨnnɔɔ a zɛ Yesɔ aɗɔ shinɛ; Ama ji zɛ ɓa nɛ Yesɔ kɔɓa. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesɔ hɨunɛ, &lt;&lt; Sum a sɨn aru iviya? Shɔu piya gbete a kãyɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Suu tɔnɛ mɛnɛ u pɛ shɔ gbete pɛli vishonɛ a jaa, kɛɗɔn suu geliunɛ,&lt;&lt; Shɔwɛrɛ naa mokaa kɛ tuunɛrɛ, a gelin ɗɔgbete a pɔ̃u aɗɔnyɛ ni, n yɛrɛ n tuupɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesɔ geli suu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Mariyamu,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Suu kɨnnɔɔ a Yesɔ bi a nwanya a nya Hibiru nɛ, &lt;&lt;Rabboniǃ&gt;&gt;(Ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ &lt;&lt;Shɔmala.&gt;&gt;)<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesɔ geli suu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Mokɔ sã naa nɛ ang biini, aru n ji sɔɔ Maye ɗɔbii pɛ ɓa. Ama yɛnɛ a mashɔzɛyi ɗɔbii a geliyi nɛ, n sɔkɛ u ɗɔbii ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Maye ai ɓeye, n Ɗalapa ai Ɗalapa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Kɛɗɔn Mariyamu suu magadala yɛrɛ geli Yesɔ jaɗɔɔyi nɛn zɛ Uɓeyetɛ kɛɗɔn a geli vigbete Yesɔ geliuyɛ piti kpai.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ shɛ au jaɗɔɔyi bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Si darɛ pɛli tɛttɔ a dii gbete lee gaa yɛ, si Yesɔ jaɗɔɔyi i toli zɔtɛ a jaa ɗɔgbete shɔ kuu nyatɔ, aru seti yupɛ̃ni yahudawayi. Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ arɛ a shi ai tete a shanɛ, binyatɔ̃nɛ u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔɔni. <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Akɨnti gbete Yesɔ sha vim yɛ, a tasiyi u naa au kagɨn ni. Yesɔ jaɗɔɔyi i nta yɛti purutɔ waanɛ a Yesɔ zɛnɛni. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesɔ geli sɔ̃n nɛ, &lt;&lt;Binyatɔ̃nɛ u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔɔni. Nɔgbete Maye shongyɛ, n kɔma n showɔ sɔ̃njo nankɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ shɛshiyi ɔ̃kinɛrɛ a geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ tɛ Ɗa Suru nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Ɔkɛ yaasi shɔ ruuvini nɛ, Ɗalapa yaasiu ruuvini tɛ gboti; Ama ɔ ji yaasiyi ɓa, Ɗalapa ji yaasiyi ruuvini ɓa,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ a Tooma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Shɔzɛ gbete atette Yesɔ jadɔɔyi kopi tu ziti, Tooma (Shɔ ɓaunɛ jabɔ̃) u si ɓa ai tete niɓa aɗagbete Yesɔ arɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Kɛɗɔn gãsi jaɗɔɔwiyi i geliunɛ, &lt;&lt;U zɛ Uɓeyelapa tɛǃ&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Tooma geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;N ji zɛ too shɔlaa dɔsinɛ ɓatɔ au naa, n tosi naa aɗɔn, n tosin naa sɔ̃n au kagɨn ɓa, n yɛn ã sisɨn ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Toti akɨnti lee maantaa si Yesɔ jaɗɔɔyi i a ɗɔzɔɔ a ɓuzɨn jaa ɗɔ gbete, a Tooma u si jo a ɗɔzɔɔ a yini, ama si shɔ Kuki nyejaa tɛttɔ, a Yesɔ torɛ a shi ai tete, a gelinɛ, &lt;&lt;binyatɔ̃nɛ u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔɔni&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geli Tooma nɛ, &lt;&lt;pɔ̃ a janaa nɛ aɗɔm, zɛn naa pɛ; gɨnn naa nɛ a pɔ̃ ang kagɨn. Yaa nya masinɛ nɛ, a ã sisɨnrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tooma kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa a n Ɗalapa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesɔ geliu nɛ,&lt;&lt;A ã sisɨn aru gbete a zɛn pɛtɛya? Ɗalapa u tasi shɔ gbeteyi i ji zɛn ɓa ama i ã sisɨn tɛ vɔ susãri abi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Laabeenɛm u dɔɔ tanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />A Yesɔ ɔ̃nɛ a koo, pɛli vibii zaanɛ waanɛ au jaɗɔɔyi nɔɔ gbete shɔ ji bee ɓa laabeenɛ mini ɓayɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Shɔ bee shom aru n ɗa ɔ ãsisɨn a ɗɔnni, nɛ Yesɔ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔshɔranɛ, Ɗalapa jaa, aru ɔ sisɨn ãnɛkɔ au bi ɔ yɛ ɔ̃ a suruni.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ shɛ au jaɗɔɔ maanzii bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Akɨnti vim, Yesɔ shɛ sɔ̃n au jaɗɔɔyi bi a nyaɓooti wapo Tibariya. N pɛ nɔgbete pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Siman Bituru, Tooma (Gbete shɔ ɓaunɛ jabɔ̃) Nataniyɛ ( Shɔgbete shɛ arɛ a Kaana a tipi Galili), Zabidi ɓɛjaayi, a Yesɔ jaɗɔɔ gãsi wɔyi ziti i sijo ɗɔzɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Siman Bituru geli gãsi jadɔɔyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;N yɛ pɛ a ɗɔɔ jazɨng sãnɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">I geliunɛ. &lt;&lt;U yɛ yɛjo a mɔkɔni,&gt;&gt;Kɛɗɔn i to latosi rɛ i yɛrɛ, ama a zɨng bau kpai i ji sã vi wɔɔ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Naa dii kɛ kaanɛ, kɛɗɔn Yesɔ shi a nya sassa mii wapo, ama u jaɗɔɔyi i ji zɛ ɓa nɛpɛ ukɔ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ hɨyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Jakasayi ɔ ji sã vi wɔɔ ɓaya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">I kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt; ko vi wɔɔ ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Yesɔ geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ loki jang nɛ a ka nakɨn ɗɔgbete latosi mii aɗɔnyɛ, ɔ yɛ sãtɔ.&gt;&gt;Kɛɗɔn i lokiyi jang rɛ ama i ji zɛnɔɔ jang-u shɛshinɛ ɓa a miini ɓa, aru gbete i sã jazɨng waanɛ.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Yesɔ jaɗɔɔ gbete au ɔriuyɛ geli Bituru nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shompɛ Uɓeyelapa!&gt;&gt;Naa Bituru ntatɛ nɛ pɛ Uɓeyelapa, kɛɗɔn tuu u fãrã a tosirɛ, aru u si bi waati, yurɛ a tasi a yɛti mii. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Gãsi Yesɔ jaɗɔɔyi i arɛ nyasasa a yɛti latosi, i ɗɔɔ jang gɔ̃nɛ yiitɛ a jazɨnni lot, i si ɓa kpɛlɛ a nyadoddoni ɓa, mɛnɛ dɔɔ laa maani. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Naa i to nyasasatɛ, kɛɗɔn i zɛ sheli yaarɛ ɗɔu, a jazɨng ni au yuu wɔsɔ̃n borodi. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt; Ɔ n ti jazɨng gãsi gbete ɔ sãyɛ dɔdɔrim pɛ yɛm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Siman Bituru yɛrɛ to latosi rɛ miyi shɛshi jang rɛ a nyasasa, jang u yii a jazɨng pẽniɓa ni laa maanzii au jaa kopi tu taati, si jazɨn wi jitɔ waanɛ a nankɔni jang u ji ntaa ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesɔ geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ anɛ u sha vishaanɛrɛ.&gt;&gt;U jaɗɔɔwi i ji hɨu ruu ɓa nɛ,&lt;&lt;Mɔkɔ piya?&gt;&gt;Aru i zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ pɛ Uɓeyelapa. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ yurɛ a tuu borodi a ãirɛ, pɛli sɔ̃n ji nankɔ a jazɨnni.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Shom kɔ ɔ̃rɛ ɓa taati gbete Yesɔ shɛ au jaɗɔɔyi bi yɛ akɨnti gbete yuu a suruni sàà yɛ.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ a Bituru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Naa i yisi vishaanɛ shaanɛtɛ, Yesɔ geli Siman Bituru nɛ, &lt;&lt;Siman Yɔhana ɓɛɛ jaa, a ɔrin tɛttɔ tɛɛ shɔ gãsi miyi ɓɛɛtɛ ya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Siman Bituru kasinya nɛ&lt;&lt;Nn, Uɓeyelapa, a zɛ tɛttɔ n ɔraatɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesɔ geliunɛ,&lt;&lt;Kɔsin jamɛrɛ̃yitɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yesɔ geli Simani Bituru sɔ̃n nɛ, &lt;&lt;Siman Yɔhana ɓɛɛ jaa, a ɔrintɛ ya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Siman kasi Yesɔ nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Nn, Uɓeyelapa, a zɛ tɛttɔ n ɔraatɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesɔ geliunɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɔsin mɛrɛ̃yi tɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Toti ɓa taati Yesɔ geli Siman nɛ, &lt;&lt;Siman Yɔhana ɓɛɛ jaa, a ɔritɛ ya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Bituru sisɨn lɛsirɛ aru nɛ Yesɔ hɨu ruu gbetenkɔ ɓaa taati, Yesɔ hɨu sɔ̃n nɛ, &lt;&lt;A ɔrintɛ ya?&gt;&gt; Siman kasi Yesɔ nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa, a zɛ ko iviya tɛttɔ; a zɛ tɛttɔ nɛn ɔraatɛǃ&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesɔ geliunɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɔsin jamɛrɛ̃yitɔ. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />N gelɔɔm pɛ nizɛ: Aɗagbete a si jakasa yɛ, ɗɔgbete ɔ kasi yɛnɛ a yɛtɔ a ɗagbete a kasiyɛ; ama naa akɛ kpẽnɛ, a yɛ gɨnnaa nɛ shɔwɔ u tosaa virɛ bi u n taa ɗɔgbete a ji kasi yɛnɛ ɓayɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />(Yesɔ sha vim u tasi nɔgbete Bituru yɛ vɔyɛ au yɛ n ti Ɗalapa nii bassinɛ.) Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliunɛ,&lt;&lt;Gɨnnɛ! &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ au jaɗɔɔ wɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Bituru zaa kɨnnɔɔ au knti a zɛ Yesɔ jaɗɔɔ gbete Yesɔ ɔriuyɛ, shɔgbete u si a Yesɔ ɗɔbiini maani aɗagbete i si ɗɔɔ vishaanɛ yumusinɛ tɛnɛɗa shaanɛyɛ, Yesɔ jadɔɔu hɨnɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa, shɔu yɛ mɛlaa yɛ piya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Naa Bituru zɛutɛ, hɨ Yesɔ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa, Jaam fa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesɔ kasiunya nɛ, &lt;&lt;N si tɔnɛn kasitɔ nɛu ɔ̃ a suruni setɛ n sɔɔtɛ, a ruu kɛnɛ-ivi ɗɔn viya? Gɨnnɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Kɛɗɔn ruum to shɔgbete i gɨn Yesɔ sho piti kpai nɛ, Yesɔ jaɗɔɔ shɔm nɛyɛ vɔ ɓa. Ama Yesɔ ji shaɓa nɛyɛ vɔɓa ɓa; Yesɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;N si tɔnɛn kasitɔ nɛu ɔ̃ a suruni setɛ n sɔɔtɛ, a ruu kɛnɛ-ivi aɗɔn viya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Yesɔ jaɗɔɔ gbete au nwanya ayuu vimiyi yɛ, bee sɔ̃n tɛttɔ; u zɛ tɛttɔ viu shayɛ pɛ nizɛ.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Vi wɔɔ ɗɔn gbete Yesɔ pɛli waanɛ. Shɔ si tɔnɛn beetɔ gbete gbete kpai, ang zɛnɛ shɔ kootipimiyi kpai i si yɛ zɛnɔɔ laabeenɛm sãnɛ dɔɔɓa.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>